<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">MRK-POGORO</book>
  <para style="h">MARIKU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shisoweru Shiwagira shakalembiti Mariku</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mariku</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mak</para>
  <para style="mt2">SHISOWERU SHIWAGIRA SHAKALEMBITI</para>
  <para style="mt1">MARIKU</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOLERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shisoweru Shiwagira shakalembiti Mariku ndo shimu pakati pa vintola vyamsheshi Mulipatanu lya Syayi vyankuyowelera makaliru ga Yesu Kristu. Kila shintola shimu pa avi vishemwa Injili, pashiwera na mana “Shisoweru Shiwagira”. Vintola vya Matayu na Mariku na Luka na Yohani vilembitwi Pakuhowa kwa Yesu. Shisoweru Shiwagira sha Mariku ndo Shisoweru Shiwagira shididini pakati pa virii visoweru viwagira vyamsheshi. Imanikana kuwera ndo Shisoweru Shiwagira sha kwanja kulembwa kuliku virii visoweru viwagira vimonga na shilembitwi pakati pa shinja sha malongu sita na muhanu mpaka shinja sha malongu saba Pakwiyuka kwa Yesu. Wabetula wajimira kuwera Shisoweru Shiwagira ashi shilembitwi Rumi kwa kuwapanana moyu wantu yawamjimiriti Yesu aku Rumi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mariku viraa kamanikana kwa litawu limonga Yohani Mariku, yakaweriti pamuhera na ntumintumi Paulu na Barinaba kumbiti uzyumi wakuwi upunguliti palii pakaliwusiyiti mumwanja gwawu gwa untumintumi, Matendu 13:13. Pa Mariku kagenditi kayi mwanja pamuhera na Barinaba, Matendu 15:37-39. Mariku viraa kamanikaniti ndo ganja gwa pakwegera na Peteru, 1Pet 5:13. Mariku kaweriti ndiri kapitawu gwa kuwona kuusu makaliru ga Yesu, wabetula wajimiriti kuwera Mariku kalembiti gavuwa kuusu galii gakampikaniriti Peteru pakayoweriti kuusu makaliru ga Yesu kayi ndo lyanjiru lya shintola ashi. Mushisoweru Shiwagira, Mariku katakuliti nakamu kuusu wafundwa na mafundu ga Yesu mulishaka lya upeleru.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagaweramu</para>
  <para style="io">Mariku kankushilanguziya shintola, shipandi sha 1:1-13.</para>
  <para style="io">Shakapanu Mariku kankulonga utenderu wa Yesu pakaweriti Galilaya, shipandi sha 1:14-8:21.</para>
  <para style="io">Shakapanu kankuyowelera kuusu mwanja gwa Yesu aku Yerusalemu, shipandi sha 8:22-10:52.</para>
  <para style="io">Mariku kankumalalira kulemba kuusu shaka sha Yesu aku Yerusalemu, pamuhera na kuhowa kwakuwi na kuzyuka kwakuwi, shipandi sha 11:1-16:8.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Lihengu lwa Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Shisoweru Shiwagira ashi sha Yesu Kristu, Mwana gwa Mlungu.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Yankuyanja gambira Isaya mbuyi gwa Mlungu ntambu yakalembiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“Mlungu kalongiti, ‘Guloli numtuma ntumintumi gwangu hakakulongoleri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">Hakakunywawili njira yaku.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Liziwu lya muntu lipikanika kushiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Mumtenderi kala Mtuwa njira yakuwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">mumnyawili weri njira zyakuwi!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yohani kalawiriti kushiwala, kawabwelera wantu na kuwabatiza, pakawagambira, “Mleki vidoda vyenu na mbatizwi na Mlungu hakawalekiziyi vidoda vyenu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Wantu wavuwa wamgenderiti Yohani, wantu yawalawiti Yerusalemu na Yudeya, walekiti vidoda vyawatenditi na yomberi kawabatiziti mulushemba lwa Yoridani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohani kavaliti nguwu yayinyawitwi kwa mibaira ya nkanyama ngamiya, mushunu kalitawiti lugoyi lwa lukuli na shiboga shakuwi shiweriti lwashi na wanjombi. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Yohani kabweriti pakalonga, “Pa neni kankwiza muntu mkulu kuliku neni. Neni nfaa ndiri ata kuyopola lugoyi lwa vilwatu vyakuwi. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Neni nukubatizani kwa mashi, kumbiti yomberi hakawabatizani kwa Rohu Mnanagala.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubatizwa na kugeziwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13">Matayu 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:11">Matayu 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Mashaka galii Yesu kiziti kulawa Nazareti lushi lwa Galilaya na kabatiziwitwi na Yohani mulushemba lwa Yoridani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Pala palii Yesu pakalawiti mumashi, kawona kumpindi kwa Mlungu kuvuguka na Rohu Mnanagala kamkangalira gambira ng'unda. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Na liziwu lilawira kumpindi kwa Mlungu, lilonga, “Gwenga gwa Mwana gwangu yanukufira, gunfiriziya.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Pala palii Rohu Mnanagala kamlongoziyiti Yesu kushiwala. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Su kaweriti kushiwala aku mashaka malongu msheshi, pakajerwa na Shetani. Kalikaliti aku pamuhera na wankanyama wa kuntundu na wantumintumi wa kumpindi wamtenderiti.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwashema walowa wamsheshi wa wasomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Yohani pawamtatiriti kala mushibetubetu, Yesu kagenditi lushi lwa Galilaya, kulii kanjiti kubwera Shisoweru Shiwagira sha Mlungu, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />pakalonga, “Shaka shiza! Ufalumi wa Mlungu wapakwegera. Mleki vidoda vyamtenda na mushijimiri Shisoweru Shiwagira!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Yesu kaweriti kankupita mumpeku mwa litanda lya Galilaya, kamwona Simoni na Andereya mlongu gwakuwi, womberi waweriti wankulowa wasomba.<figure style="fig" file="07 Fishing.jpg" size="col" ref="1:16">Muntu kankulowa wasomba</figure> <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu kawagambira, “Munfati neni, hanuwafundi mwenga muweri walowa wantu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Pala palii wazileka nyavu zyawu na wamfata.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Yesu pakagenditi palongolu padidini, kawawoniti Yakobu na Yohani wana wa Zebedayu walivagiti muuwatu wankunyawa nyavu zyawu. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Pala palii Yesu kawashema wamfati, womberi wamleka Zebedayu tati gwawu pamuhera na wantumintumi wakuwi muuwatu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntu yakawera na washamshera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu na wantumintumi wakuwi wagenditi lushi lwa Kafarinaumu, palifikiti Lishaka lya Kwoyera Yesu kagenditi munumba ya Mlungu na kanja kufunda. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Wantu yawampikaniriti Yesu walikangashiti nentu ntambu yakafunditi, toziya kafunditi ndiri gambira wafunda wawu wa Malagaliru ga Musa, kumbiti kafunditi gambira muntu yakawera na uwezu.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Shaka shilaa shilii kuweriti na muntu yakaweriti na washamshera Munumba ya Mlungu, yomberi kabotanga, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Yesu gwa Nazareti, gwana shishi na twenga? Shagwizira gutwagamiziyi? Neni nukumana kala kuwera gwenga gwa gaa, gwenga gwa Mnanagala gwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu kamkalipira shamshera ulii, “Umatu, gumwuki muntu ayu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Shamshera kambegeziya nentu muntu ulii pakabotanga, shakapanu kamlekeziya. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Wantu woseri walikangashiti nentu na wanjiti kulikosiya, “Shishi ashi? Aga mafundu ga syayi yagawera na uwezu! Muntu ayu kawera na makakala ga kuwawinga washamshera na womberi wamjimira!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Su visoweru vyakatenditi Yesu vipikinirika kanongola koseri mumkowa gwa Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwaponiziya wantu wavuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Palaa palii pawalawiti Munumba ya Mlungu, womberi wagenditi pamuhera na Yakobu na Yohani mpaka ukaya kwa Simoni na Andereya. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Pawasokiti palii, womberi wamgambiriti Yesu kuwera nahonga gwa Simoni kapyupa kagonja mushitanda. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Su Yesu kamgendera mlweri, kamkola liwoku na kumgolosiya, mawu ulii kawera mkomu na kanja kuwatelekera.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Pamihi mshenji paguzyetiti, wantu wamjegera Yesu walweli woseri na walii yawaweriti na washamshera. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Wantu woseri wa lushi lulii wajojinikiti paluwaga lwa numba. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yesu kawaponiziyiti wantu wavuwa yawaweriti na malweri ga kila ntambu. Viraa kawawingiti washamshera, kafiriti ndiri washamshera watakuli shintu shoseri toziya waweriti wankumumana.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankubwera Kugalilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4:42-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Shilawu yakuwi ligonugonu, Yesu kalawa kunja kwa lushi na kagenditi pahala pa gweka kumluwa Mlungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Kumbiti Simoni na wayaguwi wagenditi kumsakula. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Na pawamwoniti kala wamgambira, “Kila muntu kankukusakula!”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Kumbiti Yesu kawankula, “Tugendeni pahala pamonga pa lushi zyaziwera pakwegera, su neni nwezi kubwera aku viraa toziya ashi ndo shashinjegiti kushitenda.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Su yomberi kagenda Mugalilaya kwoseri pakabwera mnumba za Mlungu na kuwawinga washamshera.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankumponiziya muntu yakawera na ungumbula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Mungumbula yumu kamgenderiti Yesu kasuntumala na kamluwa, “Pagufira gumweni gumpungi neni.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu kamwonera lusungu nentu, kamkola liwoku kalonga, “Neni nfira, gupungwi.” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Palaa palii Muntu ungumbula umlekeziya. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Shakapanu Yesu kambereziya muntu ulii, kamlekeziya kagendi zyakuwi <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />pakamgambira, “Nagumgambira muntu yoseri visoweru avi, kumbiti gugendi gwakaliranguziyi kwa mtambika gwa Numba ya Mlungu na gulaviyi malaviwu kwajili ya kupungwa kwaku gambira Musa ntambu yakalagaliriti kuwera ukapitawu kwa woseri kuwera guponiziwa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Kumbiti muntu ulii kagenda kanja kubwera visoweru vya kuponiziwa kwakuwi kwa kila yakamwona. Su Yesu kasinda kuliyonisiya mulushi lulii, yomberi kalikaliti pahala pa gweka. Pamuhera na hangu wantu waweriti wankumgendera yomberi kulawa wega zoseri.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponaziya muntu yakalewelekiti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayu 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Pa mashaka gavuwa ndiri, Yesu kawuyiti Kafarinaumu, wantu wapikinira handa kawuya ukaya. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Wantu wavuwa wajojinikiti palii mpaka paweriti kwahera lupenu mnumba, ata kunja paligomi. Nayomberi kaweriti kankuwabwerera shisoweru sha Mlungu. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Su wantu wamu wiziti pawamjega muntu yakalewelekiti, yomberi kapapitwi na wantu wamsheshi. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Toziya wantu waweriti wavuwa, wasinditi kumjega pakwegera na Yesu. Su wabomoliti pashitwiku pahala pakaweriti Yesu. Shapakanu wamsulusiya muntu ulii yakalewelekiti pakawera mulisaga. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu pakawoniti njimiru yawu, kamgambiriti muntu ulii yakalewelekiti, “Mwana gwangu, vidoda vyakuwi vilekiziwa.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Wafunda wamu wa Malagaliru ga Musa waweriti walivaga kweni aku, walihola mumyoyu mwawu, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Iwera ashi muntu ayu kankutakula ntambu ayi? Ayu kankumwigilanga Mlungu! Gani kawezi kulekiziya vidoda? Mlungu gweka yakuwi ndiri?”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Pala palii Yesu kashimana shilii shawaliholiti mumyoyu mwawu. Yomberi kawakosiya, “Ashashi mwankulihola hangu mumyoyu mwenu? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Shizotopa ng'anji shii, kumgambira muntu yakalewelekiti, ‘Vidoda vyaku vilekiziwa’ ama kumgambira, ‘Gwimuki, gutoli lisaga lyaku gugendi?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Su nfira muvimani kuwera Mwana gwa Muntu kana uwezu gwa kulekiziya vidoda pasipanu.” Shapakanu kamgambira muntu ulii yakalewelekiti, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Nukugambira, gugoloki, gutoli lisaga lyaku, gugendi ukaya kwaku!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Yomberi kagoloka, palaa palii kanyasula lisaga lyakuwi kagendagenda pakalolwa na wantu woseri. Woseri walikangasha, wamkwisa Mlungu pawalonga, “Hatweniwoni shintu gambira ashi nakamu!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamshema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayu 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu kagenda kayi kumpeku kulitanda lya Galilaya. Lipinga likulu lya wantu limgendera, nayomberi kanja kuwafunda. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Pakaweriti kankupita, kamwona Lawi mwana gwa Alifayu, kalivaga mnumba mwa kulipira kodi. Yesu kamgambira, “Gunfati.” Lawi kagoloka, kanfata.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Shakapanu, Yesu kaweriti kankuliya shiboga ukaya kwa Lawi. Watola kodi wavuwa na walii yawawashema wawera na vidoda waweriti wankuliya pamuhera na Yesu na wafundwa wakuwi, toziya kuweriti na wantu wavuwa yawaweriti wankumfata. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Wafunda wamu wa Malagaliru ga Musa waweriti shipinga washishema Mafalisayu pawamuwoniti Yesu kankuliya pamuhera na “walii yawawashema wawera na vidoda” na watola kodi, womberi wawakosiya wafundwa wakuwi, “Iwera ashi Yesu kankuliya pamuhera na watola kodi na yawawera na vidoda?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu pakagapikaniriti aga kawagambira, “Wantu washinashina wamfira ndiri bwana mganga, kumbiti walweli wamfira. Niza ndiri kuwashema wantu yawalihola wankumfiriziya Mlungu, kumbiti niza kuwashema yawawera na vidoda.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Koya kuliya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayu 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Wafundwa wa Yohani Mbatiza na wafundwa wa Mafalisayu waweriti wankoya kuliya. Wantu wamu wamgendera Yesu na kumkosiya, “Iwera hashi wafundwa wa Yohani Mbatiza na wafundwa wa Mafalisayu wankoya kuliya, kumbiti wafundwa waku woya ndiri kuliya?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu kawankula, “Wantu pawawera mumsambu gwa ndowa waweza hashi koya kuliya shaka mpalu gwa ndowa kapamuhera nawomberi? Nakaka mpalu gwa ndowa pakawera na womberi hapeni woyi kuliya. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Kumbiti shaka shankwiza, mpalu gwa ndowa hakawusiwi kwawu, na panu ndo hawoyi kuliya.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Kwahera muntu yakasona shiraka sha nguwu ya syayi mu nguwu ngona. Pakatenda hangu, shiraka sha syayi hashidegi nguwu ngona, na palii papadegekiti pongereka. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Na kwahera muntu yakaweza kutula divayi ya syayi muviwiga vigona. Pakatenda hangu, divayi ya syayi hayivipantangi viwiga avi, divayi hayitiki, na viwiga havipantangiki. Kumbiti divayi ya syayi itulwa muviwiga vya syayi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankufunda kuusu lishaka lya kwoyera</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayu 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Lishaka limu lya kwoyera, Yesu pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi waweriti wankupita mumalambu ga nganu. Pawaweriti wankupita, wafundwa wakuwi wanjiti kubenanga mikunguwi ya nganu. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Su Mafalisayu wamgambira Yesu, “Guloli! Iwera ashi wafundwa waku wankutenda shintu shashileweritwi mulishaka lya kwoyera?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu kawankula, “Hamwenibetuli ntambu Dawudi yakatenditi pamuhera na wayaguwi palii pawaweriti na njala na wahera shintu? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Dawudi kingiriti Mnumba ya Mlungu mumashaka galii ga mtambika mkulu Abiyatali. Kaliya mabumunda yagalaviyitwi kwa Mlungu, mabumunda gagalekeziwa ndiri kugaliya kumbiti watambika gweka yawu ndo yawalekeziwitwi kugaliya, Dawudi kagaliyiti na kuwapanana wayaguwi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Shapakanu Yesu kawagambira, “Lishaka lya kwoyera walitula kwajili ya wantu, na wantu ndiri kwajili ya lishaka lya kwoyera! <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Su Mwana gwa Muntu ndo Mtuwa ata gwa lishaka lya kwoyera.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankumponiziya muntu yakawera na liwoku lyalilewelekiti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayu 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Shapakanu Yesu kingira kayi munumba ya Mlungu. Mlii paweriti na muntu yakawera na liwoku lyalilewelekiti. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Wantu wamu waweriti wankumlola su wawoni handa hakamponiziyi muntu ulii mulishaka lya kwoyera su wapati toziya ya kumsitaki. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu kamgambira muntu ulii yakaweriti na liwoku lyalilewelekiti, “Gwizi panu.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Shapakanu Yesu kawakosiya wantu, “Hashi, lyoshi lyaliherepa mulishaka lya kwoyera, kutenda gaherepa ama gadoda? Kumponiziya muntu ama kulaga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Kumbiti womberi wanyamalira jii. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu kawalola wantu woseri walii kwa maya, kahinginikiti nentu toziya ya ukamala wa myoyu mwawu. Shapakanu kamgambira muntu ulii, “Gunyoshi liwoku lyaku.” Yomberi kanyosha, pala palii liwoku lyakuwi lipona nakamu! <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Pala palii Mafalisayu walawiti kunja, wanja kusakula ntambu ya kumlaga Yesu, womberi pawawera na shipinga sha wantu wa Herodi.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lipinga lya wantu lyankumfata Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi uganu na wagenditi kulitanda lya Galilaya, na lipinga lya wantu limfatiti kulawa Galilaya mkowa gwa Yudeya. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Viraa virii Yerusalemu na mumikowa ya Idumeya na kumwambu kwa lushemba Yoridani na lushi lwa Tiru na Sidoni. Lipinga lya wantu awa wavuwa wamgenderiti Yesu toziya wavipikiniriti vitwatira vivuwa vyakatenditi. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Toziya lipinga lya wantu lyaliweriti likulu, Yesu kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi wamtuliri uwatu, su wantu nawambabanika. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Kawaponiziyiti walweli wavuwa, walii yawawera na malweli waweriti wankumbabanika su wapati kumshinkula. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Kila mala washamshera pawamwoniti Yesu, waguwiti pasi kulongolu kwakuwi na wagutanga pawalonga, “Gwenga gwa Mwana gwa Mlungu!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Kumbiti Yesu kawakaripiriti nentu washamshera walii nawalonga kuwera mweni ndo gaa.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankusyagula wantumintumi lilongu na awili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayu 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Shapakanu Yesu kakweniti kulugongu, kawashema walii yakawafiriti mweni, nawomberi wamgendera. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Kawasyagula wantu lilongu na awili viraa kawashema wantumintumi, su wapati kuwera pamuhera na yomberi na su kapati kuwatuma wagendi kuwabwelera wantu <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />na waweri na uwezu wa kuwalaviya washamshera.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Awa ndo wantu lilongu na awili yakawasyaguliti, Simoni, Yesu kamupananiti litawu Peteru na <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yakobu na Yohani mlongu gwakuwi, woseri wana wa Zebedayu, Yesu kawashema Bowanerigi, mana yakuwi “Wana wa Kuguguma” viraa vilii <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andereya na Filipu na Batolumayu na Matayu na Tomasi na Yakobu mwana gwa Alifayu na Tadeyi na Simoni Mkanani <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />na Yuda Isikariyoti, ayu ndo yakamgalambukiti Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwezu wa Yesu ulawiti kwa gaa?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matayu 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luka 12:10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Shapakanu Yesu kawuyiti ukaya. Lipinga likulu lya wantu wajojinikiti kayi mpaka Yesu na wantumintumi wakuwi wasinditi kuliya shiboga. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Walongu wakuwi pawapikaniriti gawatakuliti wantu, wagenda kumtola, toziya wantu watakuliti, “Kana lukwali.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Wafunda wa Malagaliru ga Musa yawalawiti Yerusalemu walongiti, “Ayu kana Belizebuli! Mkulu gwa washamshera ndo yakamupanana makakala ga kuwalaviya washamshera.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Yesu kawashema, kawagambira kwa mifanu, “Kwa ntambu ashi Shetani kamlaviyi Shetani myaguwi? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Ufalumi pawupalangika, ufalumi hapeni ugoloki. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Viraa kaya payipalangika, kaya ayi hayiyagamili. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Handa Shetani pakalilema mweni pakawera kapalangika, hapeni kagoloki kumbiti upereru wakuwi usoka.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />“Kwahera muntu yakaweza kwingira mnumba mwa muntu yakawera na makakala, kumbiti huti kamtawi muntu ulii. Shapakanu hakawezi kuvitola vintu vyoseri.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Nukugambirani nakaka, wantu hawalekiziwi vidoda vyawu vyoseri na mayigilangu gawu goseri. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Kumbiti muntu yoseri yakamwigilanga Rohu Mnanagala hapeni kalekiziwi nakamu, toziya vidoda avi vyankulikala mashaka goseri.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu katakuriti hangu toziya wantu wankulonga, “Kana washamshera.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawu na walongu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayu 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Shapakanu mawu na walongu wa Yesu wasoka. Wagoloka kunja, wamtuma muntu kingiri mnumba wakamshemi. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Lipinga likulu lya wantu liweriti limzinga Yesu. Womberi wamgambira, “Mawu gwaku na walongu waku wa kunja wankukusakula.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu kawankula, “Mawu gwangu na walongu waneni washina gaa?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Shapakanu kawalola wantu yawamzingiti na kutakula, “Mloli! Awa ndo mawu gwangu na walongu wangu! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Muntu yoseri yakatenda ntambu ya kafira Mlungu, ayu ndo mlongu gwangu na dada gwangu na mawu gwangu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa muntu yakayala mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayu 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu kanja kayi kufunda mumpeku mulitanda lya Galilaya. Lipinga lya wantu limeingikiti liweriti likulu mpaka kakweniti muuwatu uweriti mumashi na kulivaga amu. Wantu woseri walivaga kumpeku kulitanda. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Kawafunda vitwatira vivuwa kwa mifanu. Mumafundu gakuwi kawagambiriti,<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Mpikaniri! Paweriti mkweta mbeyu kagenditi kukweta mbeyu. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Pakaweriti kankukweta mbeyu, zimonga zitulukira munjira, wampongu wiza na kuziliya. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Zimonga zitulukira mulitalawu lyahera litapaka livuwa. Mbeyu azi zimeriti kanongola toziya litapaka lididini. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Kumbiti pagulawiti mshenji, gulunguziya mbeyu zyazimeriti toziya mishigira yakuwi igenda ndiri pasi. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Zimonga zitulukira pa misontu, zikula na misontu izibabanika mbeyu zyazimeriti, ndo zilera ndiri. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Zimonga zitulukira mulitapaka liherepa zimera, zikula na kulera, yimu malongu matatu na zimonga malongu sita na zimonga miya”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Shapakanu Yesu kawagambira, “Yakana na makutu, kapikiniri!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mana ya mifanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayu 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Yesu pakaweriti gweka yakuwi, walii yawaweriti pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi lilongu na mbili, wamkosiya kuusu mifanu yakuwi. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yesu kawagambira, “Mwenga mpananwa kuvimana bada ya Ufalumi wa Mlungu, kumbiti kwa walii yawawera kunja, kila shintu utakula kwawu kwa mifanu. <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />Su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Pawalola, kumbiti wavimani ndiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Pawapikanira, kumbiti werewa ndiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Nawiza kugalambuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Pawambuyira Mlungu na kulekiziya vidoda vyawu.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kagutakulira mfanu gwa muntu yakakweta mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayu 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Shapakanu Yesu kawakosiya, “Su muvimana ndiri mana ya mfanu agu? Su muvimana hashi mifanu yimonga? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Ulii mkweta mbeyu, kankukweta shisoweru. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Wantu wamonga walifana gambira yagalawiriti mumbeyu zazitulukiriti munjira. Pawapikanira visoweru vya Mlungu, palaa palii Shetani kiza na kutola visoweru shashiyaritwi mumyoyu mwawu. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Wantu wamonga walifana gambira yagalawiriti mumbeyu zazitulukiriti mumabuwi. Pala paliya pawapikanira visoweru, washitola kwa kunemelera. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Toziya wahera mishigira, wakwendereya katepu. Ndabiri na tabu paviyiza kwajili ya visoweru, su palaa palii wavileka kujimilira. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Wantu wamonga walifana gambira yagalawiriti mumbeyu zazitulukiriti pa misontu. Wankuvipikanira visoweru, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />kumbiti lushera lwa makaliru aga, kufira ulunda, na kufira vintu vya ntambu zoseri, vyawayingilaga na kulibabanika visoweru, su visoweru vilera ndiri kwa wantu walii. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Kumbiti wantu wamonga walifana gambira yagalawiriti mumbeyu zyazitulukiriti mulitapaka liherepa. Awa wankuvipikanira visoweru, wavijimilira na visoweru vilera zivuwa za zilii zaziaziyaliwti, wamonga mala malongu matatu, wamonga mala malongu sita na wamonga mala miya”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shikoluboyi shawagubikiti.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8:16-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu kendereyiti kuwagambira, “Hashi tulongi muntu kingiziya shikoluboyi mnumba na kushigubikira na shiwiga ama kushitula kulivungu? Hashi kashitula ndiri panani pa shintambi? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Toziya shiraa shintu shawafifa ashiweri paweru. Shoseri shawagubika ashigubutuliki. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Muntu yakawera na makutu, kapikaniri!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Viraa vilii Yesu kawagambira, “Mpikaniri weri galiya gampikanira! Malagaliru galii mwagatumiyaga kuwahiga wamonga, Mlungu hakagatumii kuwahiga mwenga, kayi hawongeli. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Toziya muntu yakawera na shintu hawamwongeli, na muntu yakahera shintu, ata shintu shididini shakaweriti nashi, hawampoki.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa mbeyu yayimera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu kendereya kutakula, “Ufalumi wa Mlungu ulifana hangu. Muntu kankuyala mbeyu mulirambu. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Pashiru kankugonja mpota, paliwala ka masu na mbeyu zilii zankumera na zikula. Mweni kamana ndiri ntambu yazimera. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Litapaka lyeni litenda vyavimeriti vikula na kulera, vyanja vitomolera mihamba, kayi mikunguwi, shapakanu ipunta. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Kumbiti usaka paukamala, palaa palii muntu ayu kanja kuwuhenga kwa hengu yakuwi, toziya shaka sha kubenanga shizakala.”<figure style="fig" file="12 Sickle.jpg" size="col" ref="4:29">Muntu kankuhenga usaka kwa hengu </figure><verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa mbeyu ndidini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayu 13:31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu katakula kayi, “Ufalumi wa Mlungu ulifana na shintu gaa? Tugutakuliri kwa mifanu gaa? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Ulifana na mbeyu ndidini, mbeyu ndidini nentu kuliku zoseri zawayala mulirambu. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Kumbiti pawaiyara, yankukula na kuwera mtera mkulu kuliku mitera yoseri ya mumalambu. Kayi guwera na mitambi mikulu mpaka wampongu weza kunyawa vitukulu vyawu mumitambi ayi.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu kawabweliriti wantu visoweru vyakuwi kwa mifanu yamonga ivuwa ya ntambu ayi. Kayoweriti nawomberi ntambu yawaweziti kuvimana. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Kayoweriti ndiri nawomberi shintu shoseri pota kutenda mfanu. Kumbiti pakaweriti na wafundwa wakuwi gweka yawu, kawagambiriti kila shintu.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankulikalipira liyega</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayu 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Pamihi lishaka liraa lilii, Yesu kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi, “Tulokeni tugendi kumwambu kulitanda.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Su walileka lipinga lya wantu. Wafundwa wingira muuwatu mwakikaliti Yesu. Viraa vilii peniti na uwatu umonga umfatiti. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Pala palii, liziti liyega na mashi giza kwa likakala ganja kuwukoma uwatu, mpaka mashi ganja kumema muuwatu ulii.<figure style="fig" file="09 Boat in Storm.jpg" size="col" ref="4:37">Uwatu wankukomwa na lyega</figure> <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu kaweriti kuzyetu muuwatu, kagonja muuwatu. Wafundwa wamwimusiya, wamgambira, “Mfunda, gulishera ndiri ntambu yatusokera?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesu kimuka, kalikalipira liyega lilii, na kugagambira mashi galii, “Gunyamali jii!” Liyega linyamala, na kuwera kuzizimira jii. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Shapakanu Yesu kawagambira, “Mtira shishi mwenga? Mwakali mwahera njimiru?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Nawomberi watira nentu na walikosiya weni kwa weni, “Ayu muntu gwa ntambu gaa? Ata liyega na mashi gana makakala vyoseri vimjimilira!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponaziya muntu kana washamshera</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayu 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesu pamuhera na wantumintumi wakuwi wasoka kumwambu kulitanda lya Galilaya, muisi ya Gerasi. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Yesu pakalawiti muuwatu, palaa palii muntu yakawera na washamshera kalawiti mumpanga gagaweriti wankusira wantu. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Muntu ayu kaweriti kankulikala mumpanga gakaweriti wankusira wantu na kwahera muntu yakaweza kumtawa kayi ata kwa minyololu, <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />toziya mala zivuwa kaweriti kankutawalilwa ngoyi mumawoku na minyololu mumagulu, kumbiti kaweriti pakadumula vyoseri na kuyidumula minyololu yayiweriti mumagulu mwakuwi. Na kwahera muntu yakaweriti na makakala ga kumbata. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Mashaka goseri kaweriti kankuyerayera mumpanga na muvigongu, pakabotanga na kulikeshulanga kwa mabuwi.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Pakamwoniti Yesu kwa kutali, kamtugiriti na kumsuntamilira <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />na kalila kwa kubota pakalonga, “Yesu, Mwana gwa Mlungu yakawera kumpindi nentu! Gufira shishi kwaneni? Nukuhiga kwa litawu lya Mlungu, naguntabisiya!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Katakuriti ntambu ayi toziya Yesu kamgambiriti, “Gwenga shamshera, gumlawi muntu ayu!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Shapakanu Yesu kamkosiya, “Litawu lyaku gaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Yomberi kamwankula, “Litawu lyangu Lipinga, mana yakuwi tuvuwa!” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Shapakanu kendereya kumuhiga Yesu kuwera nakawawinga washamshera kunja muisi ilii.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Kuweriti na lipinga likulu lya wamtumbi waweriti wankuliya pakwegera pa lugongu. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Su washamshera walii wamuhiga Yesu pawalonga, “Gutulagaliri tugendi kwa wamtumbi, na gutuleki twingiri mwawu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesu kawalekiziya na washamshera walii wamlawa muntu ulii na wawayingira wamtumbi. Lipinga lyoseri lya wamtumbi elufu mbili watugira kulitanda na walidiba mumashi.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Wantu yawaweriti wankulolera wamtumbi walii watuga na kuwagambira wantu shisoweru shilii mulushi na mumalambu. Wantu wagenda kulola shilii shashilawiriti. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Pawasokiti kwa Yesu, wamwona muntu ulii yakaweriti na lipinga lya washamshera, kalivagiti pasi, kavala nguwu zyakuwi, viraa mahala gakuwi gamwuyira. Su wantu walii watira. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Na walii yawawoniti shitwatira ashi, wawagambira wantu wamonga shitwatira shashimlawiriti muntu ulii yakaweriti na washamshera, pamuhera na shashilawiriti kwa wamtumbi walii.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Su wantu wanjiti kumluwa Yesu kawuki muisi yawu.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Yesu pakaweriti kankukwena muuwatu, muntu ulii yakaweriti na washamshera kamluwa wawuki woseri.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Kumbiti Yesu kambelera. Kamgambira, “Gugendi ukaya kwa walongu waku na guwagambiri vitwatira vyoseri Mtuwa vyakakutendiriti, na ntambu yakakuwoniriti lusungu.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Su muntu ulii kagenda zyakuwi mumkowa wagushema lushi lilongu pakawagambira wantu shilii Yesu shakamtendiriti. Na wantu woseri wapikaniriti na walikangasha.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nafunda gwa Yairu na mdala yakashinkuriti nguwu ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayu 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesu pakalokiti kala na kusoka kumwambu mulitanda na pakawera pampeku palitanda, lipinga likulu lya wantu lijojinikiti pakwegera na yomberi. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Shapakanu kiza yumu gwa walongoziya wa numba ya Mlungu, litawu lyakuwi Yairu. Pakamwoniti Yesu, kamsuntamilira pa magulu gakuwi, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />kamuhiga pakalonga, “Nafunda gwangu kalwala tashitashi. Shondi, shondi, gwizi gumtuliri liwoku lyaku su kaweri mkomu na kalikali.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Su Yesu kagenda pamuhera na yomberi. Wantu wavuwa wamfatiti na kumbabanika babanika.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Panu paweriti na mdala yumu kawera na ulweri wa kusuma mwazi kwa mivinja lilongu na mbili. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Mdala ulii katabikiti nentu kwa kuwagendera waganga wavuwa na kamaliriti kila shintu shakaweriti nashi, yomberi kapona ndiri, kumbiti kendereyiti kulwala. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Yomberi pakapikaniriti visoweru kuusu Yesu, kiza kumberi kulibabanika mulipinga lya wantu, kayishinkula nguwu ya Yesu, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />toziya kaligambiriti mweni, “Panuishinkula hera nguwu ya Yesu, hamponi.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Pakayishinkuriti nguwu ya Yesu, palaa palii kusuma mwazi kwoya na yomberi kalipikanira munshimba mwakuwi kuwera ulweli wakuwi upona. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Pala palii Yesu kavimana kuwera likakala limwukiti. Su kaligalambukira lipinga lya wantu na kukosiya, “Gaa yakashinkuriti nguwu yangu?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Wafundwa wakuwi wamwankula, “Guwona wantu ntambu yawakubabanika babanika, gwenga gukosiya, ‘Gaa yakakushinkuliti?’ ”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Kumbiti Yesu kaloliti wega zoseri su kamwoni muntu yakamshinkuliti. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Na mdala ulii kashimana shintu shashimlawiriti, su kamgendera pakalendema kwa lyoga. Kasuntamilira pa magulu pa Yesu, shapakanu kamgambira unakaka woseri. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu kamgambira, “Nafunda gwangu, njimiru yaku yikuponiziya. Gugendi kwa ponga na guweri mkomu.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Yesu pakaweriti kankali kankutakula ntambu ayi, wiza wantu kulawa ukaya kwa Yairu, ulii mkulu gwa numba ya Mlungu, wamgambira Yairu, “Nafunda gwaku kahowa kala. Iwera ashi gwankwendereya kumgaziya Mfunda?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Kumbiti Yesu pakapikaniriti shawatakuliti, kalishera ndiri, kamgambira ulii mlongoziya gwa numba ya Mlungu, “Nagutira, gujimiri hera.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yesu kafira ndiri muntu yoseri kamfati kumbiti Peteru na Yakobu na Yohani na Yakobu mlongu gwakuwi. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Pawafikiti ukaya kwa Yairu, Yesu kawona wankushowangana na kawapikanira wantu wankulira na kudaya. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Su Yesu kingira mnumba kawagambira, “Ashashi mwankushowangana na kulila? Mwana hakenihowi, kagonja hera!”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Kumbiti womberi wamseka. Su kawalaviya woseri kunja, kawatola tati na mawu gwa mwana ulii pamuhera na wantumintumi wakuwi watatu yakaweriti nawu na wingira mpaka pakaweriti mwana ulii. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yesu kamkola liwoku mwana ulii, kamgambira, “Talita kumu!” Mana yakuwi, “Nafunda, nukugambira gwimuki!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Pala palii nafunda ulii kimuka na kanja kugendagenda. Nafunda ayu kaweriti na mivinja lilongu na mbili. Pagalawiriti aga, wantu walikangashiti nentu. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Kumbiti Yesu kawalagalira nentu nawamgambira muntu yoseri shitwatira ashi shashilawiriti. Shapakanu kawagambira, “Mumpanani muhinga ayu shiboga kalii.”<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumlema aku Nazareti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayu 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu kawuka pahala palii, kagenda mlushi mwakuwi na wafundwa wakuwi wamfatiti. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Palisokiti lishaka lya kwoyera, kanja kufunda mnumba ya Mlungu. Wantu wavuwa yawampikaniriti walikangasha, watakula, “Kagapata koshi goseri aga? Luhala alu kalupata koshi? Kankuweza hashi kutenda mauzauza aga? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ayu ndo ulii msongola ndiri vintu? Mwana gwa Mariya na walongu wakuwi washina Yakobu na Yosefu na Yuda na Simoni? Hashi wadada wakuwi wikala pala panu ndiri?” Su walema kumjimira.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesu kawagambira, “Mbuyi gwa Mlungu kankujimilwa pahala poseri, kumbiti kankujimirwa ndiri mlushi lwakuwi na kwa walongu wakuwi na ukaya kwakuwi mweni.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Yesu kaweziti ndiri kutenda mauzauza goseri palii, ira kawatulira mawoku walweli wavuwa ndiri, kawaponiziya. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Kalikangasha nentu toziya wantu wahera moyu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu kankuwatuma wantumintumi lilongu na mbili</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayu 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Shapakanu Yesu kavityangira vijiji vya pakwegera, pakawafunda wantu. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Kawashemiti walii wantumintumi lilongu na mbili, kanja kuwatuma wawili wawili. Kawayupa makakala ga kuwawinga washamshera. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Shapakanu kawagambira, “Namtola shintu shoseri kwajili ya mwanja, ira lukongoshu gweka hera. Namtola libumunda, ama muhaku, ama mpiya mshunu. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Mvali vilwatu, kumbiti namtola nguwu yingi Kayi. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Numba yoseri pawawashemereni, mulikali palaa panu mpaka pamwuka lushi alu. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Na pahala poseri wantu pawawashemerani ndiri pota kuwapikanira, mwuki na kupunda lidika mumagulu mwenu. Ayi hayiweri litakulilu kwa womberi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Su wagenda na kuwabwelera wantu wavileki vidoda vyawu. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Wawalaviya washamshera wavuwa na kuwaswaga lipaki walweli wavuwa na kuwaponiziya.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayu 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Mtuwa Herodi kapikanira visoweru avi, toziya litawu lya Yesu lipikanikiti pahala poseri. Wantu wamonga walonga, “Yohani Mbatiza kazyuka! Ndo mana kana likakala lya kutenda mauzauza aga.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Kumbiti wamonga walongiti, “Ayu ndo Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Na wamonga walongiti, “Ayu ndo mbuyi gwa Mlungu, handa walii wambuyi wa makashu wa Mlungu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Herodi pakapikaniriti visoweru avi, kalongiti, “Ayu ndo Yohani Mbatiza yanumdumuliti mtuwi kazyuka!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Makashu Herodi mweni kalagaliriti Yohani kabatwi na katatilwi mushibetubetu. Katenditi hangu toziya ya Herodiya yakamuyugiti pamuhera kavimaniti kaweriti mdala gwa mlongu gwakuwi Filipi. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Yohani kaweriti kamgambira Herodi, “Lilagaliru lilema gwenga kumuyuga mdala gwa mlongu gwaku!”<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Su Herodiya kamkalalira nentu Yohani, kafira kumlaga kumbiti kaweza ndiri toziya ya Herodi. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Herodi kamtiriti Yohani toziya kavimaniti Yohani kaweriti muntu muheri na mnanagala, su kaweriti kankumlolera. Kafiriti kumpikanira Yohani, tembera pakampikaniriti kala moyu gumtama nentu.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Lishaka limu Herodiya kapatiti lupenyu mumsambu gwa lishaka lya kwiwukwa kwa Herodi. Herodi kawatendiriti msambu wakolamlima wa sirikali, wakulu wa wanjagila na watuwa wa isi ya Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Nafunda gwa Herodiya pakingiriti kuvina, kamherepeziya Herodi na wahenga wakuwi. Su mtuwa kamgambira muhinga ulii, “Gunduwi shintu shoseri shagufira na neni hanukupanani.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Kalirapa kayi, “Hanukupanani shoseri shagufira, ata nusu ya ufalumi wangu!”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Palaa palii, nafunda ulii kagenda kumkosiya mawu gwakuwi, “Nduwi shishi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Nayomberi kamwankula, “Guluwi mtuwi gwa Yohani Mbatiza.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Nafunda ulii katuga mpaka kwa mtuwa na kumluwa, “Nfira gumpanani vinu vinu muluselu mtuwi gwa Yohani Mbatiza!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Mtuwa moyu gumtama nentu, kumbiti kaweziti ndiri kulema, toziya kalirapiliti palongolu pa wahenga wakuwi. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Su mtuwa kamlagilira mjagira palaa palii hakajegi mtuwi gwa Yohani. Mjagira kagenda mushibetubetu na kumdumula Yohani mtuwi. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Shapakanu kawujega mtuwi gulii muluseru na kumpanana nafunda ulii. Nayomberi kampanana mawu gwakuwi. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Wafundwa wa Yohani pawapikaniriti hangu, wagenda kuyitola nshimba yakuwi na kuyisira.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwapanana shiboga wantu wavuwa elufu muhanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayu 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohani 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Wantumintumi wawuyiti na kuliwona na Yesu, wamgambira goseri galii gawatenditi na kufunda. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Yesu kawagambira, “Tugendeni gweka yetu pahala pahera muntu, mwakwoyeri katepu.” Katakuliti ntambu ayi toziya kuweriti na wantu wavuwa waweriti wankwiza na kuwuka, mpaka wapata ndiri lupenyu lwa kuliya shiboga. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Su wawuka gweka yawu kwa uwatu, wagenda pahala pahera wantu.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Kumbiti wantu yawawoniti pawaweriti wankuwuka, wawamaniti. Su watuga kulawa lushi zoseri na wawalongolera kusoka. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Yesu pakasulukiti kulawa muuwatu na kaliwoniti na lipinga likulu lya wantu. Kawawoneriti lusungu toziya waweriti gambira wakondolu yawahera mlolera. Su kanja kuwafunda vintu vivuwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Pamihi payifikiti, wafundwa wa Yesu wamgendera na kumgambira, “Pahala panu pashiwala na mshenji guzyeta. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Guwalekeziyi wantu wagendi mumalambu na muvijiji vya pakwegera wahemeri shiboga.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Kumbiti Yesu kawankula, “Mwenga muwapanani shiboga waliyi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Wamkosiya, “Hashi tugendi twakahemeri mabumunda ya mpiya zyaziweziti kumpanana mtenda lihengu kwa myezi minani tuwapanani waliyi?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Kawakosiya, “Mnaga mabumunda maninga? Mgendi mkaloli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Pawaloliti kala, wamgambira, “Kwana mabumunda muhanu na wasomba wawili.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Shapakanu Yesu kawagambira wantumintumi wakuwi wawagambiri wantu woseri waligawi muvipinga vipinga, walivagi pasi mumihamba. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Su wantu walivaga mushipinga sha wantu miya na sha wantu malongu muhanu muhanu. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Shapakanu Yesu kagatola mabumunda muhanu galii na wasomba wawili. Kalola kumpindi, kalonga mayagashii Mlungu na kagamega mabumunda galii. Shapakanu kawapanana wafundwa wakuwi wawapanani wantu. Viraa virii kawagawira wantu woseri wasomba wawili walii. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Wantu woseri waliya na kwikuta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Wafundwa wa Yesu wasola vyavisigaliti mumabumunda na wasomba na kumemeziya mumajamanda lilongu na mbili. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Wapalu waliyiti waweriti elufu muhanu.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankugendagenda pamashi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayu 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohani 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Palaa palii Yesu kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi wingiri muuwatu, wamlongoleri kugenda Betisayida. Yomberi kaweriti kankuwaaga wantu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Pamberi pakamaliriti kulonga kwahere wantu, kagenda kulugongu kumluwa Mlungu. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Pamihi papasokiti, uwatu uweriti pakati pa litanda, kumbiti Yesu kaweriti gweka yakuwi kuisi iyuma. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Kawawona wafundwa wakuwi wankuyerayera na kushima uwatu kwa ngafu, toziya lipuga liweriti lyankuwapingira. Payiweriti pakwegera na kushiya, Yesu kawagendera pakagendagenda panani pamashi. Pakwegera kawapiti, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />kumbiti pawamuwoniti kankutyanga panani pamashi, walihola kaweriti lihoka. Wanjiti kushowangana, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />toziya woseri pawamuwoniti watiriti nentu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Palaa palii Yesu kawagambira, “Namtira, ndo neni!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Shapakanu kingira muuwatu pamuhera nawomberi na liyega linyamalira. Wantumintumi wakuwi walikangasha nentu, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />toziya waweriti wavimana ndiri mana ya kuwapanana wantu mabumunda galii, myoyu yawu iweriti ikamala.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwaponiziya walweli Genezareti.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matayu 14:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Waloka litanda, wasoka muisi ya Genezareti, panu wagugolosiya uwatu wawu. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Pawalawiti muuwatu, wantu wamumaniti ndo Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Su watugiriti mulushi zoseri na wawatola walweli mumashera na kuwajega pahala poseri pawapikaniriti Yesu pakaweriti. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Pahala poseri Yesu pakagenditi, muvijiji, mulushi, ama mumalambu, wantu wawatuliti walweli paviwanja. Wamluwa kawaleki wamshinkuli muluwiniku lwa nguwu yakuwi na woseri yawamshinkuliti waponiti.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">1 Mafundu ga wantu wagona</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matayu 15:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Mafalisayu wamu na wafunda wa Malagaliru waweriti wankulawa Yerusalemu walivaga pawamzyengeta Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Wawona wafundwa wamu wa Yesu wankuliya shiboga kwa mawoku mahumba, yani wagulula ndiri mawoku gawu ntambu ya ifiruwiti.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Toziya Mafalisayu na Wayawudi woseri waliya ndiri shiboga mpaka wagululi mawoku gawu ntambu ya wamaniti, wakoliti shitiba sha wazewi wau. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Pawalawa mumasoku waliya ndiri shintu shoseri mpaka washigululi huti ntambu ya wavimani. Viraa vilii wakoliti vitiba vimonga, gambira vilii kugulula lwindi, viwiga na vyombu vya shaba.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Su Mafalisayu na wafunda wa Malagaliru wamkosiya Yesu, “Ntambu gaa wafundwa waku wakola ndiri vitiba vya wambuyi wawu, ira womberi waliya kwa mawoku mahumbu?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu kawankula, “Isaya mbuyi gwa Mlungu katungiti weri, mwenga mwawafyangu, gambira ntambu yakalembiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Wantu awa, wanjimira kwa visoweru hera, kumbiti mumyoyu mwau, wapatali na neni. <verse eid="MRK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Kuntambikira kwawu kunfaa ndiri toziya wafunda vitiba vya wantu hera gambira malagaliru ga Mlungu.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Mwenga mugaleka malagaliru ga Mlungu na kukola vitiba vyenu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesu kendereyiti kutakula, “Mwenga mulihola muherepa, kumbiti mugalema malagaliru ga Mlungu su muvikoli vitiba vyenu. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Musa kalagaliriti, ‘Guwapanani ligoya tati gwaku na mawu gwaku.’ Kayi katakuliti ‘muntu yoseri yakamuhigilanga tati ama mawu, muntu ayu hawamlagi.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Kumbiti mwenga mfunda, gambira muntu kana shintu sha kuwatanga tati ama mawu gwakuwi, kumbiti katakula shintu ashi ‘Kolibani’ mana yakuwi mafupu kwa Mlungu, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />su mtakula kalazimika ndiri kuwatanga tati gwakuwi ama mawu gwakuwi. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Su, kwa ntambu ayi mbeziya shisoweru sha Mlungu toziya ya mafundu gamwanka. Kayi mtenda vitwatira vivuwa vya ntambu ayi.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vintu vyavimtenda muntu kaweri muhumba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matayu 15:10-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yesu kalishema kayi lipinga lilii lya wantu. Kawagambira, “Mpikaniri woseri, muvimani. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Kwahera shintu shashimwingira muntu shashiweza kumtenda kaweri muhumba. Kumbiti shashimlawa muntu ashi ndo shashimtenda muntu kaweri muhumba. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Muntu pakana makutu, kapikaniri.”<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Pakalilekiti lipinga lya wantu na kwingira mnumba, wafundwa wakuwi wamkosiya mana ya mfanu wakatakuliti. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Yesu kawagambira, “Hashi, ata mwenga mwelewa ndiri? Hashi muvimana ndiri handa shintu shashimwingira muntu kulawa kunja, shimtenda ndiri muntu kaweri muhumba, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Toziya shimwingira ndiri mumoyu, kumbiti shingira mumtima, shakapanu shilawa kunja munshimba?” Kwa kutakula hangu, Yesu kavipungiti viboga vyoseri.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Kendereyiti kulonga, “Shashilawa munshimba mwamuntu ndo shimtenda kaweri muhumba. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Toziya mumoyu mwa muntu mulawa maholu madoda na uhumba na upoka na kulaga shakapanu <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />undiyandiya na lwaliya na vidoda na upyotu na utindira na weya na mahigilangu na shinika na lipungasesi. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Madoda aga goseri galawa munshimba mwa muntu, ndo hagamtendi muntu kaweri muhumba.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njimiru gwa mdala yumu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matayu 15:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu kawuka paliya, kagenda mulushi lwa Tiru. Aku kingira mnumba na kafiriti ndiri muntu yoseri kavimani, kumbiti kaweziti ndiri kulififa. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Peniti mdala yumu, mweni nafunda gwakuwi kaweriti na washamshera, kapikaniriti visoweru vya Yesu. Palaa paliya kiza kamsuntamalira pamagulu pakuwi. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Mdala ayu kaweriti Mgiriki, mwenikaya gwa Silofainiki. Su kamluwa Yesu kamlaviyi nafunda gwakuwi shamshera kadoda. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yesu kamgambira, “Guleki huti wana wikuti. Toziya iherepa ndiri kutola shiboga sha wana na kuwasila wang'ang'a.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Kumbiti mdala uliya kamwankula, “Yina Mtuwa, kumbiti ata wang'ang'a wapasi pavitalawanda waliya shiboga shawalekiti wana!”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yesu kamgambira, “Toziya ya shisoweru ashi shagulongiti, gugendi ukaya, shamshera kamlawa kala muhinga gwaku!”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Su kagenda ukaya kwakuwi, kamwona mwana kagonja mulisaga na shamshera kamlawiti kala.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankumponiziya muntu kana majogu na bebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Shakapanu Yesu kawuka mulushi lwa Tiru, kapitira Sidoni, kasoka litanda lya Galilaya kwa kupitira mukowa lushi lilongu. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Su wamjegera muntu kana majogu viraa bebi, wamluwa kamtulili mawoku. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesu kamtura kutali na wantu. Katula vyala vyakuwi mumakutu mwa muntu uliya. Katema mata na kumshinkula lulimi. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Shakapanu kalola kumpindi kwa Mlungu, kapumula na kumgambira, “Efata,” mana yakuwi, “Guvuguki!”<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Palaa makutu gakuwi gavuguka na lulimi lwakuwi luyoposoka, kanja kutakula weri. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu kawabeliziya nawamgambiziya muntu yoseri vitwatira avi. Kumbiti ntambu yakawabeleriti, ndo ntambu yawendereyiti kubwera shisoweru ashi. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Wantu walikangasha nentu. Watakula, “Katenda vyoseri viheri, kawatenda wanamajogu kupikanira na bebi kutakula!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwapanani shiboga wantu mnu ya elufu msheshi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matayu 15:32-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Lishaka limu, lipinga limonga lya wantu waliwona kayi, waweriti wahera shiboga. Su Yesu kawashema wafundwa wakuwi, kawagambira, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Nuwawonera lusungu wantu awa toziya wapamuhera na neni kwa mashaka matatu na vinu wahera shiboga. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Handa panawalekiziya wagendi ukaya kwawu na njala hawalembuki munjira, toziya wamonga walawa kutali.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Wafundwa wakuwi wamkosiya, “Peni panu pantundu hagapatikani koshi mabumunda ga kuwawikutiziya wantu woseri awa?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu kawakosiya, “Muwera na mabumunda maninga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Nawomberi wamwankula, “Twana mabumunda saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Yesu kawagambira wantu walivagi pasi. Katola mabumunda saba, kamgambira Mlungu mayagashii. Shakapanu kagamega mabumunda galiya, kawapanana wafundwa wakuwi wawapanani wantu, nawomberi wawagawira. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Kayi waweriti na wasomba vidika vididini. Yesu kavitekelera, kawahimiziya wawapanani wantu ntambu iraa. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Wantu waliya wikuta, wafundwa wakuwi wasola visigariti wamemeziya majamanda saba. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Wantu waliyiti waweriti elufu msheshi. Su Yesu kawagambira ne mbuka. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Pakamaliliti kuwagambira ne mbuka kakwena mumashuwa pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi kagenda lushi lwa Dalumanita.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayu wafira wawoni lilangaliru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayu 12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Matayu 16:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Mafalisayu wamu wiziti kwa Yesu, wanja kulishowerana nayomberi. Wafiriti kumjera kawatenderi lirangaliru lya liuzauza kulawa kumpindi. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu kawawonera lusungu kumoyu, kalonga, “Iwera hashi shiyiwuku ashi shifira liuzauza? Nakaka nukugambirani, shiyiwuku ashi hapeni shipati lilangaliru lyoseri.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Su kawaleka, kakwena kayi muuwatu, kagenda kumwambu kulitanda.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vidodera vya Mafalisayu na vya Herodi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matayu 16:5-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Wantumintumi waliyaluwiti kutola mabumunda, waweriti na libumunda limu hera muuwatu. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu kawaberiziya, “Mukali weri na vidodera vya Mafalisayu na vya Herodi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Wantumintumi wanja kulitakuziyana weni kwa weni, “Kankutakula hangu toziya twahera mabumunda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu kavimaniti gawatakuliti, kawakosiiti, “Mbona mwankulitakuziya kuusu kuwera ndiri na mabumunda? Mwenivimani ama kupikinira? Yakali ikamala myoyu yenu? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Mwana masu, hashi mwona ndiri? Mwanaga makutu, hashi mpikanira ndiri? Mulihola ndiri? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Pamegiti mabumunda muhanu su na kuwapanana wantu elufu muhanu, mjojiniriti majamanda maninga ga yagasigariti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Wamwankula, “Gaweriti majamanda lilongu na mbili.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Pamegiti mabumunda saba na kuwapanana wantu elufu msheshi, mjojiniriti majamanda maninga yagasigariti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Wamwankula, “Gaweriti majamanda saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Su Yesu kawagambira, “Na vinu muvimana ndiri?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziya kanalwisi ku Betisayida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Yesu kasokiti Betisayida pamuhera na wantumintumi wakuwi. Aku wantu wamjega kanalwisi yumu, wamluwa Yesu kamkoli. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu kamkola liwoku kanalwisi uliya, kamjega kunja kushijiji. Kamtemera mata mumasu kamtulila mawoku, kamkosiya, “Guweza kuwona shintu shoseri?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Kanalwisi uliya kalola, katakula, “Nuwawona wantu wawoneka gambira mitera yankugendagenda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Su Yesu kamtulila kayi mawoku mmasu, yomberi katumula masu. Uwezu wakuwi wa kulola umwuyira, kalola kila shintu weri. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesu kamgambira gugendi zaku ukaya na kumuhimiziya, naguwuya kushijiji shilii.<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteru kankumjimira Yesu ndo Kristu Mlopoziya.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matayu 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Shakapanu Yesu na wafundwa wakuwi wagenditi muvijiji vya Kayisariya Filipi. Pawaweriti munjira, Yesu kawakosiiti, “Wantu watakula neni na gaa?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Wamwankula, “Wamonga watakula gwenga gwa Yohani mbatiza na wamonga Eliya na wamonga watakula gwenga guwera yumu gwa wambuyi wa Mlungu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Nayomberi kawakosiya, “Hashi, mwenga mlonga neni nagaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Peteru kamwankula, “Gwenga gwa Kristu!”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Shakapanu Yesu kawaberiziya pakawagambira, “Namumgambira muntu yoseri visoweru avi.” Litawu Kristu kwa Shigiriki mana yakuwi ndo Mlungu kamsyagula kuwera Mtuwa. Kwa Shiebulaniya litawu ali walishema Masiya.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu katakula visoweru vya kumbeza na kuhowa kwakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matayu 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Shakapanu Yesu kanjiti kuwafunda wantumintumi wakuwi. Kawagambira, “Mwana gwa muntu mpaka katabiki nentu na kulemwa na wazewi na watambika wakulu wa numba ya Mlungu na wafunda wa malagaliru. Hawamlagi, kumbiti pamashaka matatu pagapita hakazyuki.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yesu kawagambiriti vitwatira avi pota kufifa. Su, Peteru kamtola kumbwega, kanja kumkalipira. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Kumbiti Yesu kagalambuka, kawalola wafundwa wakuwi, kamkalipira Peteru pakalonga, “Guwuki kulongolu kwaneni, Shetani! Maholu gaku galawa ndiri kwa Mlungu ira ga muntu!”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Su kalishema lipinga lya wantu na wafundwa wakuwi, kawagambira, “Handa muntu yoseri pakafira kunfata, kalilemi mweni na kalutoli lupingika lwakuwi kanfati. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Handa muntu yakafira kugalopoziya makaliru gakuwi mweni hakaagamiziyi, kumbiti muntu yakagamiziya makaliru gakuwi toziya ya neni na toziya ya Shisoweru Shiwagira hakalopoziyi. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Hashi, kwana mota gaa muntu kupata isi yoseri shakapanu hakaagamiziyi makaliru gakuwi? Hakapati ndiri shintu. <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Ama muntu katendi hashi kupata kayi makaliru gakuwi? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Muntu yoseri mushiyiwuku ashi shidoda na shashimtira ndiri Mlungu, yakamonera soni neni na mafundu gangu, neni Mwana gwa muntu hanumwoneri soni muntu uliya paniza muwukwisa wa Tati gwangu pamuhera na wantumintumi wa kumpindi wananagala wa Mlungu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu kongera kuwagambira, nukugambirani nakaka, wamonga wapalaapa hapeni wahowi pota kuuwona Ufalumi wa Mlungu pawiza na makakala.<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwisa wa Yesu uwoneka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matayu 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Pagapititi mashaka sita, Yesu kawatola Peteru na Yakobu na Yohani kagenda nawa kumpindi kulugongu lutalipa gweka yawu. Pawaweriti wankulola, Yesu kagalambusiwa nshimba kulongolu kwawu, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />nguwu zakuwi zimelemeta, ziwera za neru mbuu kwahera muntu yakaweza kuputa ntambu ilii. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Wantumintumi watatu walii wawawoniti Eliya na Musa wankuyowera na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Peteru kamgambira Yesu, “Mfunda iherepa nentu twa panu. Su mbaka tunyawi visasa vitatu, shimu shaku na shimu sha Musa na shimu sha Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Ashina Peteru watira nentu, Peteru kavimana ndiri shakutakuliti.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Shakapanu shilawira shivinyiru sha liwundi shiwagubikira na liziwu lipikanirika kulawa muliwundi, “Ayu ndo mwana gwangu yanumfira, mumpikiniri.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Palapaliya wantumintumi awa walolalola, kumbiti wamwona ndiri muntu yumonga, kumbiti Yesu gweka yakuwi.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Pawaweriti wankusuluka mlugongu, Yesu kawagambiriti, namumgambira muntu yoseri vitwatira vyamuwoniti, mpaka neni Mwana gwa muntu panzyukaku kulawa kwa wahowa. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Su, wakola malagaliru aga, kumbiti waweriti wankulitakuziyana mana ya kuzyuka kulawa kwa wahowiti. <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Wamkosiya Yesu, “Iwera hashi wafunda wa Malagaliru watakula Eliya mpaka kizi huti?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Nayomberi kawankula, “Yina, Eliya kankwiza huti kuwanyawira vyoseri. Kumbiti kwa shishi su walemba mumalembu mananagala handa Mwana gwa muntu hakatabiki nentu na kulemwa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Kumbiti nukugambirani, Eliya kizakala, nawomberi wamtendera ntambu yawafiriti gambira Malembu ntambu yagatakuliti hawamtenderi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankumponiziya muntemba kana washamshera</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matayu 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Yesu pamuhera na wafundwa watatu pawawuyiti kwa wantumintumi wamonga, wawoniti lipinga likulu lya wantu na wafunda wamu wa Malagaliru waweriti wankulitakuziyana nayomberi. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Palaa palii wantu pawamwoniti Yesu, woseri walikangasha nentu, wamtugira wamlamusiyi. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu kawakosiya wantumintumi wakuwi, “Mwankulitakuziyana shishi nawa?” <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Su muntu yumu mulipinga lya wantu kawankula, “Mfunda numjega mwana gwangu kwaku, toziya kana shamshera yakamtenda kalanduli ndiri. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Kila mala pakamwizila, kamgusiya pasi na kumtenda kalawi ufulufulu mumlomu, pakagayagaya menu na nshimba yoseri iyuma. Nuwaluwiti wafundwa waku wamlaviyi shamshera uliya kumbiti wasinda.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu kawagambira, “Mwenga, shiyiwuku shashihera njimiru! Hashi hankali na mwenga mpaka ndii? Hashi hanuwahepeleri mpaka ndii? Mumjegi panu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Wamjega mwana uliya yakaweriti na washamshera, shamshera ulii pakamwoniti Yesu, palaa palii kamgusiya pasi na kumlekela shisirika, nayomberi, kagalagata na kulawa lufulufulu mumulomu. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu kamkosiya tati gwa mwana ulii, “Vitwatira avi vimpata kwanjira ndii?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Yomberi kawankula, “Kwanjira uwana wakuwi.” <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Mala zitangala shamshera ulii kamgusiyiti mumotu na mumashi su kamlagi. Payiwera guweza Gutuwoneri lusungu, gututangi!<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu kamgambira, “Iwera hashi gutakula handa guweza?” Nukugambira vitwatira vyoseri viwezekana kwa muntu yakawera na njimiru.<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Su Palaa palii tati gwa mwana ulii kabotanga pakalonga, “Njimira! Guntangi neni weri na njimiru itosha.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu pakaliwoniti lipinga lya wantu lyankuwongereka kamukamu, kamkalipiriti shamshera ulii pakamgambira, “Shamshera yagumtenda mwana ayu kaweri bebi na majogu, nukugambira gumlawi mwana ayu nagumwingira kayi!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Shamshera ulii kagutanga na kamgusiya pasi mwana ulii, kamlawa. Mwana ulii kawonekaniti handa kahowa, su wantu wavuwa walongiti, “Kahowa!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Kumbiti Yesu kamkola liwoku kamnyasula na yomberi kagoloka.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Yesu pakingiriti mnumba, wafundwa wakuwi wamkosiyiti pawawera gweka yawu, “Iwera hashi twenga tusinda kumlaviya shamshera ulii?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu kawagambira, “Shamshera gwa ntambu ayi hapeni kalawi kumbiti kalawa kwa kumluwa Mlungu hera.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankutakula kayi shisoweru sha kuhowa kwakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayu 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesu pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi wawukiti palii, wendereyiti na mwanja kupitira mukowa gwa Galilaya. Yesu kafiriti ndiri muntu yoseri kavimani pawawera, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />toziya kaweriti kankuwafunda wafundwa wakuwi. Kawagambiriti, “Mwana gwa muntu hawamlaviyi kwa wantu wamlagi. Kumbiti pagapita mashaka matatu hakazyuki.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Wafundwa wavimaniti ndiri vitwatira avi kumbiti watira kumkosiya.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gani mkulu?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayu 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Su wasokiti Kafarinaumu, na pakaweriti mnumba, Yesu kawakosiyiti wafundwa wakuwi, “Mweriti mwankulitakuziya shishi munjira?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Kumbiti womberi wanyamalira, mana munjira waweriti wankulitakuziana, “Gani mkulu pakati petu?” <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesu kalivaga pasi, kawashema walii wantumintumi lilongu na mbili kawagambira, “muntu pakafira kaweri gwa kwanja hakaweri gwa kupelera na ntumintumi gwa woseri.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Shakapanu kamtola mwana mdidini, kamgolosiya pakati pawomberi. Kamkisikira, shakapanu kawagambira, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Yakamwanka yumu gwa mwana gambira ayu kwa litawu lyangu, kananka neni na yakananka neni kananka hera ndiri neni, su kamwanka yakantumiti neni.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakatulema ndiri myetu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9:49-50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yohani kamgambira, “mfunda tumwona muntu yumu kankuwusiya washamshera kwa litawu lyaku, twenga tujera kumberiziya toziya yomberi ka yumu gwetu ndiri.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Kumbiti Yesu kawagambira, “Mleki kumberiziya, toziya kwahera muntu yakatenda mauzauza kwa litawu lyangu na palaa panu shakapanu katakuli vidoda kwaneni. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Toziya muntu yakatulema ndiri twenga, muyetu. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Nuwagambira nakaka, muntu yoseri yakakupanani mashi gakulanda toziya mwenga mwa wantu wa Kristu, nakamu hapeni kakosi kipata lifupu lyakuwi.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vintu vyavimtenda muntu katendi vidoda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matayu 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Muntu yoseri yakamtenda yumu gwa wadidini wawanjimira katendi vidoda, iweri mbaka kwa muntu uliya kumtawalira musingu mwakuwi lwala na kumwasira mulitanda. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Liwoku lyaku palikutenda gutendi vidoda, gulidumuli! Iherepa nentu kwingira muukomu wa mashaka goseri pota liwoku limu kuliku kuwera na mawoku mawili na kugenda mumotu gwa Jehanamu, motu gwakuwi gutenda ndiri tiya. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Kweni watekenya wakuwi wafuwa ndiri, wala motu gutenda ndir tiya. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Na Ligulu lyaku palikutenda gutendi vidoda, gulidumuli! Iherepa nentu kwingira muukomu wa mashaka goseri pota ligulu limu, kuliku kuwera na magulu goseri mawili na kukwasira mumotu gwa Jehanamu motu gutenda tiya ndiri. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Kweni watekenya wawaluma wafuwa ndiri na motu gutenda tiya ndiri. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Na lisu lyaku palikutenda gutendi vidoda, gulitupuli! Iherepa nentu kwingira Muufalumi wa Mlungu paguwera na lisu limu hera. Kuliku kuwera na masu gaku goseri mawili na kukwasira mumotu gwa Jehanamu gutenda tiya ndiri. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Amu watekenya wakuwi wawaluma wafuwa ndiri, na motu gutenda ndiri tiya.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“Toziya kila yumu hawampungi kwa motu.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />“Munu guherepa, kumbiti pagulawa kunoga wakuwi, hagukoleri na shishi?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Muweri na munu mngati mwenu na mulikali weri na wayenu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankufunda vitwatira vya kulileka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matayu 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu kawukiti paliya kagenda kumkowa gwa Yudeya na kalokiti kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani. Lipinga lya wantu limgendera kayi, yomberi kawafunda handa ntambu ya katenda.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Su Mafalisayu wamgendera na wamkosiya kwa kumjera, “Hashi, lilagaliru lyetu limlekeziya muntu kumleka mdala gwakuwi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu kawakosiya, “Musa kawalagalira malagaliru gaa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Nawombeli watakula, “Musa kalagaliriti mpalu kumpanani mdala gwakuwi lilembu lya kuleka na kamleki.” <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu kawagambira, “Musa kawalembiriti lilagaliru ali toziya ya kukamala kwa myoyu yenu. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Kwa njira kwanja Mlungu pakayiwumbiti Isi, kawawumbiti mwana mpalu na mdala. Gambira malembu ntambu yagatakuliti, <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Su, mpalu hakawaleki tati gwakuwi na mawu gwakuwi, hawaweri pamuhera na mdala gwakuwi, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />woseri wawili hawaweri yumu. Kwa hangu womberi hawaweri kayi ndiri wawili ira yumu. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Su shakalemetiziyiti Mlungu, muntu nakashilekeniziya.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Pawingiriti kayi mnumba, wafundwa wakuwi wamkosiyiti shitwatira ashi. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Yomberi kawagambira, “Muntu yakamleka mdala gwakuwi na kumyuga gwingi, kankuhumba. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Viraa mdala yakamleka mpalu gwakuwi na kuyugwa na gwingi, kankuhumba.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwatekelera wana wadidini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayu 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Wantu wamjegiriti Yesu wana wadidini kawatulili mawoku, kumbiti wafundwa wawakalipira wantu. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yesu pakawoniti hangu, kakalaliti kawagambira wantumintumi wakuwi, “Muwaleki wana awa wizi kwa neni, namuwalewalera, toziya Ufalumi wa Mlungu wa wantu gambira wana awa. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Nukugambirani nakaka, muntu yoseri yakanka ndiri Ufalumi wa Mlungu gambira mwana mdidini hapeni kingiri amu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Shakapanu kawanka wana awa, kawakisikira na kawatekelera.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntu kalunda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayu 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yesu pakanjiti kayi mwanja gwakuwi, muntu yumu kamtugiriti na kamsuntamilira na kamkosiya, “Mfunda muheri, ntendi hashi mpati ukomu wa mashaka goseri?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu kamwankula, “Iwera hashi gushema muheri? Kwahera yakaweriti muheri kumbiti Mlungu gweka yakuwi. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Gulimana lilagaliru, ‘Naguhumba, nagulaga, naguwiwa, nagulaviya ukapitawu gwa kupayira, nagupaya, gumupanani ligoya tati na mawu gwaku.’”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Yomberi kamwankula, “Mfunda goseri aga nugakoliti kwanjira untemba wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu kamloliti na kamfira, kamgambira, “Gupungukiwa na shintu shimu, gugendi gukawuzi vintu vyaguweriti navi na mpiya guwapanani wahushu na gwenga hagutuli shigubakiru kumpindi, shakapanu gwizi gunfati.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Pakapikaniriti aga, kahinginikiti, moyu gumtama kagenda zakuwi toziya kaweriti kalunda.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu kagalambuka aku na aku, kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi, “Ntambu gaa haiweri ikamala kwa walunda kwingira Muufalumi wa Mlungu!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Wafundwa walikangasha nentu kwa visoweru vyakuwi. Yesu kawagambira kayi, “Wana wangu, vikamala nentu kwingira Muufalumi wa Mlungu! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Vikamala nentu mlunda kwingira Muufalumi wa Mlungu kuliku nkanyama ngamiya kupena mushitoboli sha sanziya.”<figure style="fig" file="14 Camel.jpg" size="col" ref="10:25">Nkanyama ngamiya</figure><verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Wantumintumi wakuwi walikangasha nentu walikosiya, “Su gaa yakaweza kulopoziwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu kawalola kawagambira, “Kwa muntu iwezekana ndiri, kumbiti kwa Mlungu vitwatira vyoseri viwezikana.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Su Peteru kamgambira, “Na twenga hashi? Tuleka vyoseri, nakukufata!”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu kawagambira, “Nakaka nukugambirani, kila muntu yakalekiti numba ama walongu ama dada ama mawu ama tati ama wana ama malambu toziya ya neni na kwa toziya ya Shisoweru Shiwagira, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />hakanki nentu shaka ashi ama hakanki mala miya numba na walongu na wafunda na wamawu na wana na malambu pamuhera na kutabika. Shaka shiza hamuwanki ukomu wa mashaka goseri. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Kumbiti wavuwa yawaweriti wa kwanja hawaweri wa upeleru, na walii yawawera wa upeleru hawaweri wa kwanja.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankutakula mala ya tatu kuusu kuhowa kwakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayu 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Su, Yesu pamuhera na wantumintumi wakuwi waweriti munjira kugenda Yerusalemu na Yesu kaweriti kankuwalongolera. Wafundwa wakuwi waweriti wankulikangasha, na wantu yawawafatiti waweriti na lyoga. Yesu kawatola kayi kumbwega walii wafundwa wakuwi lilongu na mbili, kanja kuwagambira galii hagampati. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />“Mpikaniri! Twankugenda Yerusalemu na aku neni Mwana gwa muntu hawantuli kwa watambika wakulu na wafunda wa Malagaliru, womberi hawantozi kuhowa na hawanaviyi kwa wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Womberi hawamtenderi lidufiya na hawantemeri mata na hawasyatangi ntomondu na kumlaga. Kumbiti pagasoka mashaka matatu hakazyuki.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuluwa kwa Yakobu na Yohani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matayu 20:20-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Su Yakobu na Yohani wana gwa Zebedayu wamgendera Yesu wamgambira, “Mfunda tufira gututenderi shintu shatufira kukuluwa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu kawakosiya, “Mfira nuwatenderi shishi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Wamwankula, “Gutujimiri kukala yumu uwega waku wa kumliwu na yumonga uwega waku wakumshigi pagulivaga mushibanta sha ukwisa waku.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yesu kawagambira, “Muvimana ndiri shamluwa! Hashi, mweza kulandira lwindi lwanandira lwa ntabiku, ama mweza kubatizwa ntambu ya ubatizu wa neni?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Wamwankula, “Yina tuweza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Yesu kawagambira, “Lwindi lwanandira hamlandiri nakaka na hawambatizwi ntambu yanfira kubatiziwa, <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />kumbiti vyaneni ndiri kusyagula ayu hakalikali kumliwu ama kumshigi kwaneni, mpenyu azi ndo kwa walii yawatandilitwi kala.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Wafundwa wamonga walii lilongu, pawapikaniriti aga, wawakalaliliti Yakobu na Yohani. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yesu kawashema, kawagambira, “Muvimana handa walii yawaholiti waweri wakolamlima wa isi zimonga wawagolokera wantu wawu kwa makakala na wakulu awa wawalanguziya makakala gawu. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Kumbiti kwa mwenga nayiwera hangu, ira yakafira kaweri mkulu, hakaweri ntumintumi gwenu. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Na muntu pakati penu yakafira kaweri mkulu, hakaweri ntumintumi gwa woseri. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Toziya Mwana gwa muntu kiza ndiri wamtenderi, kumbiti kuwatendera na kulavia ukomu wakuwi uweri ukombola wa wantu wavuwa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankumponiziya lwisi Baritulumayu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayu 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Su wasoka Yeriku, Yesu na wafundwa wakuwi pamuhera na lipinga likulu lya wantu, pakaweriti kankulawa mulushi alu, kweniti kana lwisi mluwa yawamshema Baritulumayu mwana gwa Timayu, kaweriti kalivaga mbwega mwa njira. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Baritulumayu pakapikaniriti handa Yesu gwa Nazareti kankupita pahala palii, kabotanga, “Yesu, Mwana gwa Dawudi gumoneli lusungu!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Wantu wavua wamkalapira, “Gunyamali.” Kumbiti yomberi kongera kushema, “Mwana gwa Dawudi gumoneri lusungu!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu kagolokiti, katakula, “Mumshemi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Su wamshema kana lwisi ulii, wamgambira, “Gulikakamaziyi! Gugoloki, yomberi kakushema.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Yomberi kasa lihabiti lyakuwi, kakopoka, kamgendera Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu kamkosiya, “Gufira nukutenderi shishi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Kanalwisi ulii kamgambira, “Mfunda nduwa mpati kuwona.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu kamgambira, “Gugendi, njimiru yaku ikuponiziya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Pala palii kana lwisi ulii kaweza kuwona na kamfata Yesu munjira.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">1 Yesu kankwingira Yerusalemu kwa shereku shereku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayu 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohani 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Pawaweriti wapakwegera na Yerusalemu wasokiti Betifagi na Betaniya, pakwegera na Lugongu lwa Mizeyituni, palii kawatuma wawili wa wafundwa wakuwi wawalongoleri, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />kawagambira, “Mgendi mushijiji sha kulongolu kwenu. Payiwera mwakwingira amu, hamwoni mwana gwa punda wamtawa, mweni kenitenderwi na muntu. Mumyopoli mumjegi. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Handa muntu pakawakosiya, ‘Iwera hashi mtenda hangu?’ Mumgambiri, ‘Mtuwa kamfira na hakamwuziyi panu ulavinu.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Su wagenda, wamwona mwana gwa punda mumbwega munjira wamtawa muligomi. Pawaweriti wankumyopola, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />wantu wamu waweriti wagoloka palii wawakosiya, “Iwera hashi mwankumyopola punda ayu?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Wafundwa wawankula ntambu Yesu yakawagambiriti, nawomberi wawaleka wagendi zawu. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Wamjegiriti Yesu mwana punda ayu. Wayazalira nguwu zawu pampindi pa mwana punda ulii na Yesu kakwena kalivaga pampindi pakuwi. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Wantu wavuwa wayazalira nguwu zawu munjira, wamonga wayazalira miputira ya mitera yawayidumuliti mumalambu. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Wantu woseri yawalongoleriti na yawafatiti, wanjiti kubotanga, “Kakwisuwi Mlungu! Katekelerwi ulii yakiza kwa litawu lya Mtuwa! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Utekelerwi ufalumi wiza wa tati gwetu Dawudi. Kakwisuwi Mlungu gwa kumpindi nentu!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu kingiriti lushi lwa Yerusalemu, kagenda Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, Kalola kila shintu weri. Kumbiti toziya iweriti kala pamihi, kagenda Betaniya pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi lilongu na mbili.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kagupangira mtera gwa mkuyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matayu 21:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Shirawu yakuwi, pawaweriti wankulawa Betaniya, Yesu keniti njala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Su kwa kutali kaguwona mtera gwa mkuyu gwana mihamba ivuwa. Kagugendera kawoni handa guweriti na libwajubwaju loseri. Pakasokiti, kaguwoniti gwahera libwajubwaju lyoseri ira mihamba hera, toziya iweriti ndiri shaka sha mabwajubwaju. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Panu Yesu kagugambira mtera gwa mkuyu, “Kwanjira leru ata mashaka goseri muntu yoseri nakaliya mabwajubwaju kwaku!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Na wafundwa wakuwi wapikaniriti visoweru avi.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankwingira Numba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayu 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohani 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Su wasokiti Yerusalemu. Yesu kingira Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu kanja kuwawinga kunja wantu yawaweriti wankuwuza na kuhemera vintu. Kagalambuziya vintalawanda vyawaweriti wankuvunjira mpiya na vigoda vya walii yawaweriti wankushuuza wang'unda. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Kamlekeziyiti ndiri muntu yoseri kupitira paligomi lwa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu pakatola shintu. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Shakapanu kawafunda, “Ilembwa Mumalembu Mananagala, ‘Mlungu kalonga Numba yangu hawayishemi Numba ya kumluwa Mlungu kwa isi zoseri!’ Kumbiti muyitenda kuwera mpanga ya wakwepula!”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Watambika wakulu na wafunda wa Malagaliru pawapikaniriti aga, wanjiti kusakula njira ya kumlaga. Kumbiti wamtiriti toziya lipinga lya wantu lilikangashiti na mafundu gakuwi.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Paiweriti pamihi, Yesu na wafundwa wakuwi wawukiti mlushi.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lifundu kulawa kwa mkuyu yagunyaliti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matayu 21:20-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Shirawu yakuwi mandawira pee, pawaweriti wankupita, waguwoniti mkuyu guliya gunyala goseri, kwanjira kumishigira mpaka kumihamba <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Peteru kalihola visoweru vyakatakuliti Yesu, kamgambira, “Mfunda gulori! Mkuyu gulii gwagugupangiriti, gunyala!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu kawagambira, “Mumjimiri Mlungu.” <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />“Nukugambirani nakaka, muntu pakalugambira lugongu alu, ‘Gutupuki gukalyasi mulitanda,’ pota na lyoga mumoyu mwakuwi, kumbiti kajimira kuwera vitwatira vyoseri vyakatakula vinyawiki, havimnyawikili. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Hangu nukugambirani, pamumluwa Mlungu shintu shoseri, mjimiri handa mshiyanka kala, namwenga hamshiyanki shintu shoseri shamuluwiti. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Pamgoloka kumluwa Mlungu, gumlekiziyi kila muntu yakakutenderani vidoda, su Tati gwenu kakumpindi hakawalekiziyi mwenga vidoda vyenu.” <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Kumbiti handa mwenga pamulekiziya ndiri, Tati gwenu gwa kumpindi hapeni kawalekiziyi mwenga vidoda vyenu.<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakosiya ukulu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayu 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Su wasoka kayi Yerusalemu. Yesu pakaweriti kankugendagenda Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, watambika wakulu na wafunda wa malagaliru na wazewi wamgendiriti, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />wamkosiya, “Gwankutenda vitwatira avi kwa ukulu gaa? Gani yakakupananiti ukulu wa kutenda vitwatira avi?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Kumbiti Yesu kawagambira, “Hanuwakosiyani shintu shimu, pamunankula, naneni vira hanuwagambirani kwa ukulu wa gaa nankutenda vitwatira avi. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Hashi, uwezu wa Yohani wa Mbatiza ulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu ama ulawa kwa wantu? Munankuli.”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Wanja kulitakuziya, “Patutakula, ‘Ulawiti kumpindi kwa Mlungu,’ hakatukosiyi, su iwera hashi munjimira ndiri?” <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />“Hapeni tutakuli ulawa kwa wantu, patutakula hangu tutira lipinga lya wantu toziya woseri wajimiriti handa Yohani kaweriti mbuyi gwa Mlungu nakaka.” <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Su, wamwankula Yesu, “Twenga tuvimana ndiri.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Yesu kawagambira, “Naneni vira hapeni nuwagambiri ntenda vitwatira avi kwa uwezu wa gaa.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa lirambu lya mizyabibu na walimi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayu 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yesu kanjiti kutakula nawu kwa mifanu, “Muntu yumu kalimiti lirambu lya mizyabibu. Katindiliziya shibambaza na pakati pa lirambu kabawa lirindi lya kuyonera zyabibu, kanyawa lilingu lya kulolelera. Kawazimila lirambu ali kwa walimi, mweni kagenda mpaka lushi lwa kutali.<figure style="fig" file="04 Winepress.jpg" size="col" ref="12:1">Wantu wawili wankuyonera zyabibu</figure> <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Shaka sha kubenanga, kamtumiti ntumintumi gwakuwi kwa walimi walii, kamjegeri seemu ya viboga vya lirambu lyakuwi. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Walimi walii wambata, wamkoma, wamwuziya mawoku hera. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Kamtuma kayi ntumintumi yumonga, ayu viraa walimi wamkomanga mumtuwi na kumtendera vidoda. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Mweni kana lirambu ulii kamtuma kayi ntumintumi yumonga, walimi awa wamlagiti. Watenditi hangu kwa wamonga wavuwa yakawatumiti, wamonga wawakomiti, na wamonga wawalaga. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Kasigaliwiti na muntu yumu, yani mwana gwakuwi yakamfira. Upeleru kamtuma ayu pakalihola, ‘Hawamupanani ligoya mwana gwangu.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Kumbiti walimi awa waligambirana, ‘Ayu ndo muhala mweni, tumlagi su uhala wakuwi uweri wa twenga!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Su, wambata, wamlaga na kumwasa kunja kulirambu lilii.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />“Hashi, mweni kana lirambu hakatendi shishi? Hakizi kuwalaga walimi woseri na kuliyazimilira lirambu lya mizyabibu kwa wantu wamonga. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Hashi, hamwenibetuli Malembu Mananagala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Libuwi lyawaliremiti wanyawa numba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">Vinu liwera libuwi lyaliwera na mana nentu kuliku mabuwi goseri.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Mtuwa ndo mweni yakatenditi shintu ashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">Nasheni ndo shakulikangasha kwa twenga’?”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Watambika wa numba ya Mlungu na wafunda wa malagaliru na wazewi wavimaniti handa mfanu agu guweriti kawalonga womberi. Hangu wajeriti kumbata, kumbiti watiriti lipinga lya wantu. Su wamleka kagendi zakuwi.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulipira kodi kwa Kayisari</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayu 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Su Mafalisayu wamu na wantu wa shipinga sha mfalumi Herodi watumitwi su wamgomiziyi Yesu kwa visoweru vyakuwi. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Wamgendera, wamgambira, “Mfunda tuvimana handa gwenga ndo muntu yagwaminika, gutakula nakaka hera, wala gumshera ndiri muntu yoseri shakaliholiti. Gulishera ndiri ukulu wa muntu, toziya gufunda unakaka hera wa Mlungu kwa wantu. Su, gutugambiri vya halali kumupa Kayisari kodi ama ndala?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Kumbiti Yesu kavimaniti ufyangu wawu, kawagambira, “Iwera hashi mfira kungomiziya? Mnanguziyi ligwala lya mpiya.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Wamlanguziya. Yomberi kawakosiya, “Sheni na shilanguliru ashi sha gaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Wamwankula, “Shilanguliru ashi sha Kayisari.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Su Yesu kawagambira, “Vya Kayisari mumpanani Kayisari na vya Mlungu mumpanani Mlungu.” Walikangashira nentu.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shitwatira sha kuzyuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayu 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Wantu yawalawiti mushipinga sha Masadukayu, walii watakulaga kwahera muntu yakaweza kuzyuka, su wamgenderiti Yesu wamkosiya, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Mfunda, Musa katulagaliriti hangu, ‘Muntu pakahowa na kumleka mdala pota mwana, mlongu gwakuwi mpaka kamtoli mkenja ulii na kamyiwuliri wana mlongu gwakuwi yakahowiti.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Su kuweriti na walongu saba. Gwa kwanja kamyugiti, kahowa pota kumleka mwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Mlongu gwa pili kamyuga mkenja ayu na yomberi kahowa pota kuleka mwana. Ilawiriti ntambu iraayi kwa mlongu gwa tatu. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Woseri saba wahowa pota kuleka wana. Pawupeleru mdala ulii kahowa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Vinu wantu pawazyuka mulishaka lya kuzyuka, mawu ayu hakaweri mdala gwa gaa? Toziya woseri saba wamyugiti.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu kawankula, “Mwenga mwagamila toziya mgamana ndiri Malembu Mananagala ama likakala lya Mlungu. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Toziya yawahowiti pawazyuka, hapeni wayugi wala kuyugwa, hawaweri handa wantumintumi wa kumpindi. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Kumbiti kwa shisoweru sha kuzyukisiwa kwa wantu yawahowiti, hashi, mwenibetuli mushintola sha Musa shisoweru shilii sha shitogolu shashiyakiti motu, Mlungu ntambu yakamgambiriti Musa, ‘Neni na Mlungu gwa Aburahamu na Mlungu gwa Isaka na Mlungu gwa Yakobu.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Yomberi Mlungu ndiri gwa yawahowiti, ira Mlungu gwa wakomu. Su, mwenga mwagamila nentu!”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilagaliru likulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matayu 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Yumu gwa wafunda wa malagaliru kasokiti, kawapikanira Masadukayu wankulitakuziyana na Yesu. Pawawoniti Yesu kawankuliti weri, kamkosiya, “Mumalagaliru goseri, lilagaliru lyoshi likulu kuliku goseri?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu kamwankula, “Lilagaliru likulu ndo ali, ‘Gupikaniri Israeli! Mlungu Mtuwa gwetu, ndo mweni Mtuwa gweka yakuwi. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Gumfiri Mlungu Mtuwa gwaku kwa moyu gwaku goseri na kwa rohu yaku yoseri na kwa mahala gaku goseri na kwa makakala gaku goseri.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Na lilagaliru lya pili kwa ukulu ndo ali, ‘Guwafiri wamonga ntambu yagulifira gumweni.’ Kwahera lilagaliru limonga likulu nentu kuliku ali.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Su mfunda ulii gwa malagaliru kamgambira, “Iherepa Mfunda! Gutakula nakaka kulonga Mlungu yumu hera na kwahera yumonga ira yomberi. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Na gumfiri Mlungu Mtuwa gwaku kwa moyu gwaku goseri na kwa mahala gaku goseri na kwa makakala gaku goseri na guwafiri wamonga ntambu yagulifira gamweni. Shitwatira ashi shana mana nentu kuliku matambiku goseri gakulunguziya torosu kwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu pakawoniti handa muntu ayu kamwankula kwa luhala, kamgambira, “Gwenga gwakutali ndiri na Ufalumi wa Mlungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Palongolu pa aga, kwahera muntu yakajeriti kayi kumkosiya shintu.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kristu gaa?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayu 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Shaka Yesu pakaweriti kankufunda Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, kakosiyiti, “Iwera hashi wafunda wa malagaliru watakula handa Kristu mwana gwa Dawudi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Dawudi pakalongoziwitwi na Rohu Mnanagala katakuliti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Mtuwa kamgambiriti Mtuwa gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">Gukali uwega wa neni wa kumliwu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">Mpaka panuwatula wankondu waku pasi pa magulu gaku.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />“Dawudi mweni kamshema Kristu Mtuwa. Su Kristu hakaweri hashi mwana gwakuwi?” Lipinga lya wantu waweriti wankumpikanira,</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Yesu kankuwakalipira wantu kuusu wafunda wa malagaliru</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayu 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Lipinga lya wantu liweriti lyakumpikanira Yesu kwa kunemelera. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yesu pakaweriti kankufunda, katakuliti, “Mulikali weri na wafunda wa malagaliru weni wafira kulipitiziya pitiziya walikwindira lihabiti ritali na wafira wantu wawalamsiyi kwa ligoya kusoku. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Wafira kulivaga muvigoda vya kulongolu mnumba ya Mlungu, na kutola mpenyu ziherepa pamsambu <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Wawayonga wakenja aku wankulipayira kumluwa Mlungu kwa shaka shitali! Lishaka lya kutoza hawatabiki nentu!”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaviwu ga mdala mkenja</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu kaweriti kalivaga pakwegera na lisanduku lya luhanja. Kaweriti kankulola wantu wavuwa ntambu yawaweriti wankulavia mpiya na kuzitula muluhanja lwa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu. Walunda wavuwa walaviyiti mpiya zivuwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Kiza mkenja muhushu kalaviya senti ndidika mbili zya mpiya. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Panu Yesu kawashema wafundwa wakuwi, kawagambira, “Nukugambirani nakaka, mkenja muhushu ayu kalaviya zivuwa kuliku wamonga woseri yawatuliti mpiya mulisanduku lya luhanja. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Mana woseri walaviya kulawilirana na mpiya zyazisigalliti, kumbiti mawu ayu, tembera muhushu, kalaviya vyoseri vyakaweriti navi, kalaviya kila shintu shakafiriti kwa kulikala.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Numba nkulu ya Mlungu hayibomoki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayu 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu pakaweriti kankulawa Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, mfundwa yumu kamgambiriti, “Mfunda Guloli mabuwi aga na numba azi ntambu yaziwera za kulikangashira!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu kamgambira, “Hashi, guziwona numba azi nkulu? Kwahera ata libuwi limu halisigali panani pa limonga, kila shintu hashibomolwi.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwanja kwa tabu na ntabiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu pakaweriti kalivaga kulugongu lwa Mizeyituni kulolana na Numba nkulu ya Mlungu, su Peteru na Yakobu na Yohani na Andereya wamkosiya pambwega gweka yawu. <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Gutugambiri vitwatira avi havilawili ndii? Lilangaliru gaa halilanguziyi handa vitwatira avi vyapakwegera kulawira?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu kanja kuwagambira, “Mulikali weri muntu nakiza kukuzyangani. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Wantu wavuwa hawizi pawalitendera litawu lyaneni, pawalishema, ‘Neni ndo Kristu!’ Womberi hawawapotuziyi wantu wavuwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Pampikanira ngondu na tetesutetesu zya ngondu, namuwera na lyoga. Vitwatira avi mpaka vilawiri, kumbiti upeleru weni wankali. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Isi yimu hailikomi na isi imonga, ufalumi wumu haulikomi na ufalumi umonga, pahala pavuwa hapaweri na malendemeru na njala. Vitwatira avi gambira pakwanja kutama kwa kulera nonu.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Mwenga mulikali weri! Mana wantu hawawajegeni kushyotera motu, na kuwakomanga mnumba ya Mlungu, Hawawajegi palongolu pa utuwa na wafalumi toziya munjimiriti neni, su mpati kuwagambira visoweru viwagila. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Mpaka huti Shisoweru Shiwagira shibweruwi kwa isi zoseri. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Nawomberi pawakubateni na kuwajega kushyotera motu, namulihola kwa galiya gamfira kutakula, shaka shilii pashiza, mtakuli shoseri shakakupananeni, mana mwenga ndiri yamfira kutakula, kumbiti Rohu Mnanagala. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Mlongu hakamgalambuki mlongu gwakuwi kalagwi na tati hakamgalambuki mwana gwakuwi na wana hawawatenduwi walera wawu na kuwalaga. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Wantu woseri hawawakalalireni mwenga toziya ya litawu lyaneni. Kumbiti ulii yakahepelera mpaka upeleru ndo hakalopoziwi.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likalaliru lihalibisiya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matayu 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Pamwona ‘Likalaliru lihalibisiya’ ligoloka pahala pakuwi ndiri, muntu yakabetula kavimani mana yakuwi, panu wantu yawawera Yudeya watugili mumigongu. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Muntu yakaweriti pampindi pashitwiku sha numba nakasuluka kwingira mnumba mwakuwi kutola shintu. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Yakawera mulirambu nakawuya ukaya kutola lihabiti lyakuwi. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Shondi shondi wamawu yawawera na yinda na walii yawanoniziya mumashaka galii! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Mumluwi Mlungu vitwatira avi navilawira mashaka ga mbepu. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Mana kupeluwa kwa shaka ashi hakongeleki nentu hakwenilawili kwanjira Mlungu pakanyawiti isi mpaka leru, hapeni ilawiri kayi. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Handa Mtuwa mekapunguli ndiri mashaka aga kwahera muntu hakalopolwi. Kumbiti su kwajili ya wasyagulwa wakuwi, Mtuwa kapungula mashaka aga.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Su muntu pakawagambirani, ‘Guloli, Kristu kapanu!’ Ama ‘Ka palii!’ Namjimira. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Mana hawalawili ashina Kristu wa upayira na mambuyi wa upayira, hawatendi malangaliru na mauzauza, su kuwapotuziya wasyagulwa wa Mlungu handa payiwezikana. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Su mwenga mulikali weri. Neni nukugambirani vitwatira vyoseri pamberi vyenilawiri.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Mwana gwa muntu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayu 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Mashaka aga, pagapera kala, mshenji hagutulwi luwindu na lyezi hapeni lilangali. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Ntondu hazituluki kulawa kumpindi na makakala ga kumpindi hagazitikiziyi. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Panu hawamwoni Mwana gwa muntu pakiza mumawundi na likakala likulu pamuhera na ukwisa. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Shakapanu hakawatumi wantumintumi wa kumpindi wawajojiniri wasyagulwa wakuwi kulawa wega zoseri msheshi za pasipanu, kulawa upeleru wa pasipanu mpaka upeleru wa mpindi.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lifundu kulawirana na mkuyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayu 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Mleki mtera gwa mkuyu guwafundi. Mitambi ya mitera payanja kunama na kutomola mahamba, muvimani kuwera shaka sha kutowa vula shapakwegera. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Ntambu iraa ayi mwenga pamwona vitwatira avi vyankulawira, muvimani handa shaka shapakwegera nentu. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Nakaka nukugambirani, shiyiwuku ashi hapeni shipiti pamberi pa vitwatira vyoseri avi kulawira. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Mpindi na isi hapeni zipiti, kumbiti visoweru vyangu su hapeni vipiti.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwahera yakamana lishaka ama saa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matayu 24:36-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Kumbiti kwahera muntu yakavimana lishaka ama saka, ama ntumintumi gwa kumpindi, ama Mwana, kumbiti Tati gweka yakuwi ndo mweni yakavimana. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Mloli weri na mshenjeri, mana muvimana ndiri shaka hashi hashisoki ndii. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Hayiweri handa muntu yakawuka ukaya kugenda mwanja pakawalekera wantumintumi wakuwi, kila yumu na lihengu lyakuwi. Shakapanu kamgambira mlolera ligomi kaweri masu. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Su mulikali masu, toziya muvimana ndiri mweni kaya hakawuyi ndii, pamonga pamihi ama pashiru ama mandawira putiputi. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Handa pakiza vumu nakawawona mgonja. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Ganawagambirani mwenga, nuwagambira wantu woseri, ‘Mulikali weri!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">1 Mpangu gwa kumlaga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayu 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohani 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Gasigariti mashaka mawili pamberi pa kusoka mumsambu gwa Pasaka na mabumunda gawalekera ndiri simika. Watambika wakulu wa numba ya Mlungu na wafunda wa malagaliru waweriti wankusakula njira ya kumbata Yesu wamlagi. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Su watakula, “Tuleki kumbata mumsambu gwa Pasaka, toziya wantu hawatendi ndewu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuswagwa lipaki aku Betaniya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayu 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohani 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu kaweriti Betaniya mnumba mwa Simoni mungumbula. Pawaweriti pashintalawanda wankuliya shiboga, mawu yumu yakaweriti na supa ya lipaki lya utuli wa beyi nkulu kiza. Kaimega supa ayi na kamumiminira Yesu lipaki mumtuwi.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Wantu wamu waweriti panu wakalaliti, walitakuliziyana, “Iwera hashi kwananga lipaki linunkira ali? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Megaweziti kuwuza kwa mpiya za shibenamgongu sha shinja shimu, na kuwapanana wahushu!” Wamkalipira mawu ayu. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Kumbiti Yesu kawagambira, “Mumleki, iwera hashi kumgaziya? Kantendera shintu shiherepa. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Hamuweri na wahushu mashaka goseri, hamuwezi kuwatanga shaka shoseri shamfira. Kumbiti neni hapeni weri na mwenga mashaka goseri. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Yomberi katenda ntambu yakaweziti, kayitilira nshimba yangu lipaki lya utuli kuyitandira kwa kusira. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Nukugambirani nakaka, poseri muisi Shisoweru Shiwagira pashibweruwa, shitwatira ashi shakatenditi hashikandwi ntambu ya kulihola.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kakujimira kumgalambuka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayu 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Shakapanu Yuda Isikariyoti, yumu gwa walii lilongu na mbili, kagenditi kwa watambika wakulu su kamgalambuki Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Watambika wa numba ya Mlungu pawapikaniriti shisoweru ashi, wasekelera, wamlagaliti kumpanana mpiya. Su, Yuda kanja kusakula lupenyu lwa kumgalambuka kwa Watambika wakulu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matandiru ga Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayu 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:14-23">14-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohani 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Lishaka lya kwanja lya Msambu gwa Mabumunda yagawalekerwa ndiri simika, shaka sheni mwanakondolu gwa Pasaka pakalikitulwa, wafundwa wakuwi wamkosiyiti, “Gufira tukutandiri koshi shiboga sha Pasaka?” <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Su Yesu kawalagalira wawili wa wafundwa wakuwi pakawagambira, “Mgendi mlushi, na amu hamuliwoni na mpalu yumu yakalitwika vulu ya mashi. Mumfati <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />mpaka mnumba yakingiri, mwakamgambiri mweni kaya, ‘Mfunda kalonga sha koshi shuwogu sheni handiyi Pasaka pamuhera na wafundwa wangu?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Yomberi hakawalonguziyi shuwogu shikulu mligolofa amu vyoseri wavitandira kala, mtutandiri amu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Wafundwa wawuka, wagenda mlushi, wawona kila shintu weri ntambu yakawagambiriti Yesu. Su watandira shiboga sha pasaka. <verse eid="MRK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Payiweriti pamihi, Yesu kiziti pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi lilongu na mbili. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Pawaweriti pashitandawala wankuliya, Yesu katakuliti, “Nakaka nukugambirani, yumu gwenu yakaliya pamuhera naneni, hakang'alambuki.” <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Panu wafundwa wakuwi wanja kulihola, yumu yumu wamkosiyiti, “Hashi, neni?” <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu kawagambira, “Yumu gwenu mwenga lilongu na mbili, yakashwika libumunda pamuhera naneni mubakuli. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Nakaka Mwana gwa muntu hakahowi handa Malembu Mananagala ntambu yagatakuliti kwakuwi, kumbiti shondi kwakuwi muntu ulii yakamgalambuka Mwana gwa muntu! Hayiweri kwa muntu ulii handa mekayiwuki ndiri!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shiboga sha Mtuwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayu 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-23">Luka 22:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wakorintu 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Pawaweriti wankuliya, Yesu katoliti libumunda, kalonga mayagashii Mlungu, kalimega na kawapanana wafundwa wakuwi pakalonga, “Mtoli mlii, ayi ndo nshimba ya neni.” <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Shakapanu katola lwindi lwa divayi, kalonga mayagashii Mlungu, kawapanana, woseri walanda mulwindi alu. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Kawagambira, “Agu ndo mwazi gwangu gwagulawa kwajili ya wantu wavuwa. Mwazi gwangu gwagulanguziya lipatanu lya Mlungu na wantu. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Nakaka nukugambirani, hapeni nandi kayi divayi mpaka lishaka lilii panfira kuyilanda divayi yasyayi Muufalumi wa Mlungu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Shakapanu wimba lwimbu, wawuka, wagenda kulugongu lwa Mizeyituni.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankutunga handa Peteru hakamlemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayu 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wakorintu 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu kankuwagambira wafundwa wakuwi, “Mwawoseri hamtugi na kundeka, toziya Malembu Mananagala galonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:27">‘Mlungu hakamlagi mlolera gwa kondolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:27">Na wakondolu hawapangalanyiki.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Kumbiti panzyuka kala, hanuwalongoleri Galilaya kulii!” <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Peteru kamgambira, “Handa woseri hawakuleki, neni hanukulemi ndiri!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu kamgambira Peteru, “Nakaka nukugambira, pashiru panu, pamberi njogolu keniwiki mala mbili, hagunemi mala ntatu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Kumbiti Peteru kalilapira, “Ata payiwera nfuwi pamuhera na gwenga, hapeni nukulemi.” Wafundwa woseri viraa watakula ntambu iraa ayi.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Kankumluwa Mlungu mushiwunga Getisemani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayu 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Su, wasoka mushiwunga shawashishemiti Getisemani. Yesu kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi, “Mulivagi panu shaka neni nankumluwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Shakapanu kawatola Peteru na Yakobu na Yohani, kanja kulishera nentu na kushashatika. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Kawagambira, “Moyo gwangu guntama nentu, ata sambira howa. Mukali panu na muweri masu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Kagenda kulongolu kidogu, kasuntumala makukama, kamluwa Mlungu, handa payiwezekana, shimpiti shaka ashi sha ntabiku. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Kalonga, “Tati!, Tati gwangu, kwa gwenga vitwatira yoseri viwezikana. Gumpusiliri lwindi lwa ntabiku alu, kumbiti hayiweri handa ntambu yanfira neni, ira ntambu yagufira gwenga.” <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Shakapanu kawuya kwa Wafundwa walii watatu, kawoniti wagonja. Su kamkosiya Peteru, “Simoni, hashi gugonja? Guweza ndiri kulikala masu ata lisaa limu?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Shakapanu kawagambira, “Mukali weri na mumluwi Mlungu su namwingira mukujerwa. Rohu ifira, kumbiti nshimba yahera likakala.” <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Kagenda kumluwa Mlungu kayi pakawuyira visoweru viraa vilii. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Shakapanu kawuya kayi kwa wafundwa walii kawawoniti wagonja. Masu gawu gaweriti gana mpota. Wavimana ndiri sha kumwankula. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Pakawiziriti mala ya tatu kawagambiriti, “Mwankali mwankugonja na kwoyera? Vinu itosha! Saa isoka! Muloli, Mwana gwa muntu wankumpanana kwa wantu yawawera na vidoda. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Mwimuki, tugendeni zetu. Mloli, ulii yakafira kung'alambuka kapakwegera.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumbata</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayu 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohani 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yesu Pakaweriti kankali kankutakula, Yuda, yumu gwa wafundwa lilongu na mbili, kiza pamuhera na lipinga lya wantu wana mapanga na vindonga. Wantu awa waweriti walagalilwiti na watambika wakulu na wafunda wa Malagaliru na wazewi. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yuda mgalambuka kaweriti kawalanguziya lilanguliru, “ulii hanumnoneri ndo mweni, mumbati na kumjega wakamloleri.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Yuda pakasokiti, kamgenderiti Yesu, kamgambira, “Mfunda.” Shakapanu kamnonera. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Wantu walii wambata Yesu, na kumtawa. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Yumu gwa walia yawaweriti wagoloka pamuhera na Yesu, kasolomola ligumba lyakuwi, kamdumula likutu ntumintumi gwa Mtambika mkulu. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu kawagambira, “Vyamwiza na mapanga na vindonga kumbata gambira neni na mkwepula? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Kila lishaka nweriti pamuhera na mwenga panfunda Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, wala mumbata ndiri. Kumbiti vinu Malembu Mananagala ga kala.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Panu wantumintumi woseri wamleka, watira. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Kweniti na muntemba yumu yakaweriti kavala lishuka kaweriti kankumfata Yesu. Nawomberi wajeriti kumbata, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />kumbiti yomberi kayirekiziya shuka yakuwi, katuga shivula hera.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu palongolu pa shiyotera motu sha Wayawudi.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matayu 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohani 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Su wamjega Yesu kwa Mtambika mkulu peni Watambika wakulu woseri na wazewi na wafunda wa malagaliru waweriti waliwona. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Peteru kamfatiti Yesu kwa kutali, kingira muluwaga lwa numba ya mtambika mkulu, kalivaga pamuhera na walolera ligomi pakotera motu. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Watambika wakulu wa shiyotera motu sha Wayawudi woseri wasakula upitawu wa kumsitaki Yesu wapati kumlaga, kumbiti wapata ndiri. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Wantu wavuwa walaviyiti upitawu wa kupaya kwa Yesu, kumbiti upitawu wawu ujimilirana ndiri. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Shakapanu wamonga wagolokiti, walaviya upitawu wa kupaya pawatakula, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Tumpikaniriti muntu ayu pakatakula hanuhalibisiyi Numba nkulu ya Mlungu yawanyawiti kwa mawoku, na kwa mashaka matatu hanuinyawi imonga yawainyawa ndiri kwa mawoku.” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Kumbiti ata hangu, upitawu wawu ujumilirana ndiri.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Su, Mtambika mkulu kagoloka pakati pawu, kamkosiya Yesu, “Hashi, gwankula ndiri shisoweru? Wantu awa gawawoniti kwa gwenga?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Kumbiti yomberi kalikaliti jii katakula ndiri ata shisoweru shimu. Mtambika mkulu gwa numba ya Mlungu kamkosiya kayi, “Hashi, gwenga ndo Kristu, Mwana gwa Mlungu yawamkwisa?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu kankula, “Neni ndo mweni. Kayi hamumoni neni Mwana gwa muntu pakalivaga uwega wa kumliwu wa Mtuwa yakawera na makakala, pakiza mumawundi ga kumpindi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Panu Mtambika mkulu kapapula lihabiti lyakuwi, kalonga, “Tufira ndiri kayi wakapitawu wamonga? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Mpikanira kankumwigilanga Mlungu! Mwenga mwona hashi?” Woseri wamtoza, kafiruwa kuhowa. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Su wamu wawu wanja kumtemera mata, wamgubikira sheni, wamkoma na kumgambira. “Gutungi gaa yakakukomiti!” Walolera ligomi wamtola, wamwakula.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteru kankumlema Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matayu 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohani 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Peteru pakaweriti kankali paluwaga, mdala yumu gwa wantumintumi wa Mtambika Mkulu kiziti. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Pakamwoniti Peteru kankuyotera motu, kamloliti, kamgambira. “Viraa gwenga guweriti pamuhera na Yesu Mnazareti.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Peteru kalema, “Numumana ndiri, wala nuvimana ndiri gagutakula!” Shakapanu Peteru kawuka, kagenda kunja kuwuwa. Panu njogolu kaweka. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Ntumintumi mdala ulii pakamwoniti kayi Peteru, kanja kayi kuwagambira wantu yawaweriti wagoloka palii, “Muntu ayu yumu gwawu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Peteru kalema kayi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Shakapanu katepu, wantu waweriti wagoloka palii wamgambira Peteru. “Nakaka gwenga gwa yumu gwawu, toziya gwenga gwa Mgalilaya.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Kumbiti Peteru kanja kulirapa, pakatakula, “Neni nummana ndiri muntu ulii yamtakula visoweru vyakuwi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Palaa palii njogolu kaeika mala ya pili. Su Peteru kalihola ntambu Yesu pakaweriti pakamgambira, “pamberi pa njogolu keniwiki mala ya pili, hagunemi mala ntatu.” Peteru kalira nentu.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kapashiyotera motu pa Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayu 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohani 18:28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Pawushiiti, watambika wakulu wa numba ya Mlungu watenditi lishawuli pamuhera na wazewi na wafunda wa malagaliru na wantu wa shiyotera motu woseri, wamtawa Yesu minyoloru wamjega pashiyotera motu pa Pilatu.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilatu kamkosiya Yesu, “Hashi, gwenga gwa Mfalumi gwa Wayawudi?” Yesu kamwankula, “Yina, gwenga gutakula.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Watambika wakulu wampayiliti Yesu vitwatira vivuwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilatu kamkosiya kayi Yesu, “Hashi gwankula ndiri shisoweru? Guloli ntambu yawalaviya masitaka gavuwa kwaku.”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Kumbiti Yesu kankula ndiri shisoweru, ata Pilatu kalikangasha.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumtoza kuhowa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayu 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohani 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Kila Shaka sha msambu gwa Pasaka, Pilatu kaweriti na shitiba sha kuwavugulira mtatilwa yumu yawamfira. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Su, kuweriti na muntu yumu yawamshema Baraba, yakaweriti wamtatira pamuhera na wamonga yawalagiti wantu pawaweriti wakusonguziya. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Wantu wavuwa wamgendera Pilatu wamluwa kawatenderi handa shitiba shakuwi. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilatu kawakosiya, “Hashi, mfira nuwavuguliri Mfalumi gwa Wayawudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Katakula hangu toziya kavimaniti kala handa watambika wakulu wamjegeriti Yesu toziya ya weya. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Kumbiti Watambika wakulu wawasonguziyiti wantu wamluwi Pilatu kamvuguliri Baraba. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilatu kawakosiya kayi, “Su, mfira ntendi hashi na muntu ayu yamumshema Mfalumi gwa Wayawudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Wantu woseri washowangana kayi pawatakula, “Gumkong'onderi palupingika!” <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Kumbiti Pilatu kawakosiya, “Gwa shishi! Katenda shidoda gaa?” Kumbiti womberi wongera kushowangana, “Gumkong'onderi misumali palupingika!” <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilatu kafiriti kulifiliziya lipinga lya wantu awa, su, kamlekeziya Baraba kulawa mushibetubetu. Kawagambira wanjagila wamkomi ntomondu Yesu na wamkong'onderi misumali palupingika!<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanjagira wankumtendera lijonga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matayu 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohani 19:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Shakapanu wanjagila wamjegiti Yesu muluwaga muliboma lya Pilati mkulu gwa isi, wawajojinira shipinga shakuwi shoseri. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Wamvalisiya nguwu ya nsheri, wapota lijenjeri lya misontu wamvalisiya mumtuwi. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Wanja kumlamsiya, “Mwika Mfalumi gwa Wayawudi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Wamkoma mumtuwi kwa ludengi, wamtemera mata, wamsuntamalira na kumng'ong'onelera. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Pawamshinigira kala wamvuliti lihabiti lilii, wamvalisiya nguwu zakuwi, shakapanu wamjega kumpingika.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wamkong'ondera misumali palupingika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayu 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohani 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Pawaweriti munjira, waliwoniti na muntu yumu yawamshema Simoni, muntu gwa lushi lwa Kureni. Yomberi kaweriti tati gwa Alekizanda na Rufu na shaka ashi kaweriti kankulawa kulirambu. Su, wamgambira katoli lupingika lwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Shakapanu wamjega Yesu mpaka pahali pawapashema Goligota, mana yakuwi, “Pahala pa Shipalakasa sha mtuwi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Wampanana divayi yawahanganyikiti na mtera wagushema manimani, kumbiti yomberi kalemiti kulanda. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Su wampingika, wagawana nguwu yakuwi kwa kuzigalambuziya simbi, wamuwi gaa hakapati shipandi sha nguwu. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Iweriti saa tatu mandawira pawampingikiti. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Na masitaka gakuwi gaweriti galembwa, “Mfalumi gwa Mayawudi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Pamuhera nayomberi wapingikitwi wakwepula wawili, yumu uwega wakuwi wa kumshigi na yumonga uwega wakuwi wa kumliwu. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Su lilembu litimii lyalitakula, “Wamwalangiti pamuhera na watenda vidoda.”<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Wantu waweriti wankupita pahala panu wamwigilangiti, pawatikiziya mituwi yawu na kutakula, “Aha! Gwenga gutakuliti gumweni guweza kubomola Numba nkulu ya Mlungu na kunyawa kwa mashaka matatu! <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Vinu, gusuluki mlupingika gulilopoziyi gumweni!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Nawomberi watambika wakulu pamuhera na wafunda wa malagaliru wamshinigiriti pawalitakuziyana, “Kawalopoziya wamonga, kumbiti kasinda kulilopola mweni! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Eti yomberi ndo Kristu, Mtuwa gwa Israeli! Kasuluki kulawa palupingika su tuwoni na kujimira.” Ata wantu walii yawapingikitwi pamuhera nayomberi wamuhigilangiti.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuhowa palupingika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayu 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohani 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Kwanjira saa sita pamihi mpaka saa tisa kuweriti liwindu isi yoseri. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Saa tisa pamihi Yesu kalila kwa liziwu likulu, pakalonga, “Eloyi, Eloyi, lama sabakitani?” Mana yakuwi, “Mlungu gwangu, Mlungu gwangu iwera hasi gundeka?” <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Wantu wamonga yawagolokiti paliya pawapikaniriti hangu, watakuliti, “Gupikaniri! Kankumshema Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Muntu yumu katuga, katola lidodoki kalitawa mulupeleru lwa ludenki katota mudivayi isheshema, kampananiti kalandi pakatakula, “Ebu tuloli handa Eliya hakizi kumsulusiya palupingika!” <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yesu kabota, shakapanu kahowa.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Su, lipaziya lya Numba nkulu ya Mlungu lidegeka vipandi viwili kulawa kumpindi mpaka pasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Mkulu yumu gwa wanjagila yakaweriti kagoloka kulongolu kwa lupingika kawoniti Yesu ntambu yakahowiti, kalonga, “Nakaka muntu ayu kaweriti Mwana gwa Mlungu!” <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Wadala wamu waloliti kwa kutali, muwamu mwawu kaweriti Mariya Magidalena na Salomi na Mariya mawu gwa ashina Yakobu mpusu na Yosefu. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Awa ndo yawamfatiti Yesu pakaweriti Galilaya na kumtendera. Kuweriti na wadala wamonga wavuwa wiziti Yerusalemu pamuhera na yomberi.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumsira</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayu 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohani 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Shaka sha pamihi shisokiti kala. Ali liweriti Lishaka lya matandiru, lishaka lyalilonguleriti Lishaka lya Kwoyera. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Panu kiza Yosefu mwenikaya gwa Arimatayu, mjagira gwa Shiyotera motu mkulu, yawampananiti ligoya nentu. Yomberi viraa kaweriti kankulolera kwiza kwa Ufalumi wa Mlungu. Su, kamgenderiti Pilatu pota na lyoga, kaluwa wampanani mauti ga Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilatu kalikangasha kupikanira handa Yesu kahowiti kala. Su kamshema Mkulu gwa wanjagila, kamkosiya handa Yesu kaweriti kahowa shaka shivuwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Pilatu pawamgambiriti kala, kamgambiriti Yosefu katoli nshimba ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Panu Yosefu kuhemera sanda ya shitani, kasulusiya pasi mauti galiya, kaviliga sanda. Kagatula mulipumba lyaliweriti walisongola mulitalawu, shakapanu kabilingisiya libuwi likulu kuligomi. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Nawomberi Mariya Magidalena na Mariya mawu gwakuwi Yosefu wapawoniti pawagonjikiti nshimba ya Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">1 Kuzyuka kwa Yesu kulawa kwa wahowiti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayu 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohani 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Palipititi Lishaka lya kwoyera, Mariya Magidalena na Salomi na Mariya mawu gwakuwi Yakobu wahemeriti lipaki lya utuli wagendi kuyiswaga nshimba ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Su mandawira putiputi lishaka lya Jumapili. Kwa Shigiriki jumapili walishema lishaka lya kwanja la juma, mshenji pagwanjiti kulawa wiziti Mulipumba. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Nawomberi waweriti wankuligambiziyana, “Gani hakatuwusiliri libuwi lilii paligomi lya lipumba?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Kumbiti pawaloliti, wawona libuwi waliwusiya kala. Nalyeni liweriti likulu nentu. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Pawayingiriti Mulipumba, wamwoniti muntemba yumu yakavaliti nguwu neru mbuu, kalivaga uwega wa kumliwu, walikangasha nentu. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Kumbiti muntemba ulii kawagambira, “Namulikangasha. Mwankumsakula Yesu gwa Nazareti yawampingikiti. Kazyuka, kwahera panu. Mloli pahali pawamgonjekiti. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Mgendi mwakawagambiri wafundwa wakuwi pamuhera na Peteru. ‘Handa Yesu kankuwalongolera Galilaya kulii. Aku hamumwoni ntambu yakawagambireni.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Su walawa mulipumba mlii na watuga pawashashatika kwa lyoga na kulikangasha. Wamgambira ndiri muntu yoseri shintu, toziya watira nentu<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankumlawira Mariya Magidalena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yesu pakazyukiti Jumapili mandawira putiputi, kalilanguziya kwanja kwa Mariya Magidalena, yomberi Yesu kaweriti kamlaviyiti washamshera saba. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Mariya Magidalena kagenda, kawagambira walii yawaweriti pamuhera na Yesu. Waweriti wankulira na kudaya. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Kumbiti pawapikaniriti handa Yesu mkomu na Mariya Magidalena kamwona, womberi wajimira ndiri.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwalawira wafundwa wawili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24:13-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Shapakanu Yesu kawalawiriti wafundwa wawili pakawera na sheni shingi. Wafundwa awa waweriti wankugenda kuvijiji. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Nawomberi viraa wawuya na kuwagambira wayawu. Pamuhera na hangu wajimira ndiri.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwalawira wantumintumi lilongu na yumu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayu 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohani 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Matendu 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Upeleru Yesu kawalawiriti wafundwa lilongu na yumu pawaweriti pamuhera pashitalawanda. Kawakalipira nentu toziya ya kujimira ndiri kwawu na mtiti gwawu, mana wawajimira ndiri walii wawaweriti wamwona pakazyukiti kala. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Su, kawagambira, “Mgendi muisi zoseri mkabweri Shisoweru shiwagira kwa wantu woseri. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Yakajimira na kubatizwa hakalopoziwi. Yoseri yakajimira ndiri hakatozwi. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Walii yawajimira hawaweri na uwezu wakutenda mauzauza. Kwa litawu lyangu hawawusiyi washamshera na hawatakuli kwa likabira lyasyayi. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Pawakola njoka ama pawalanda shintu shoseri shana usungu, hapeni wayambuki. Hawawatuliri walweli mawoku, nawomberi hawaweri wakomu.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wamtola kugenda kumpindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Su Mtuwa Yesu pakatakuliti kala nawomberi, kanyasulitwi kugenda kumpindi kwa Mlungu, kalivaga uwega wa kumliwu wa Mlungu. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Wafunda wagenda pahala poseri pawabwera. Mtuwa katenda lihengu pamuhera nawomberi na kukamaziya shawabwera kuwera sha nakaka na mauzauza gaweriti pamuhera nawomberi.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>